COPY public.cidafm_commands (id, type, name, description, default_active, is_builtin, created_at, updated_at) FROM stdin;
842e1239-f1eb-4226-b912-5cce37795f46	!	import-cid	Read a CID and process its contents. If a [Context] section is present, add its contents to current chat memory. If an [AFMs] section is present, store the AFMs without activating them.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
95d887ff-1bc7-4516-8d28-b30f72a317f8	!	export-context	Summarize the current chat memory in preparation for transfer to a new chat. Returns a detailed, cold-start compatible summary under a [Context] tag.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
4e9797e9-6c06-4f4d-b460-2a8492bd9dda	!	state-check	Create a list of all currently active state modifier AFMs and their current toggle status (on or off).	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
cce6654b-6bc0-48e8-b1b1-f4cb011e870a	!	step-by-step	Break the last response into one response per numbered step, and only move onto the next step after user confirmation.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
4f11ad90-7428-4217-a9c7-0de0834c7290	^	cidafm-optimize	Take the requested text and create a new version that is token-efficient, clear of redundancies, and context-independent. Then assess the newly generated text for meaningfulness retention, token efficiency, lack of redundancy, and context-independence.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
eb759e02-6eab-47ad-b4fd-638a76f76098	^	fad	Assume the contents of the prompt are a proposition, then provide the best argument for it, followed by the best argument against it. Then, provide your decision based on both arguments.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
97ec5ee0-5c36-4302-a0c5-9aeabb12dce2	^	concise	Make only the current response concise and to the point, minimizing word count while preserving meaning.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
c2ac26a4-5687-4e81-bcb9-51bd31197a18	^	detailed	Provide a comprehensive and detailed response with thorough explanations and examples.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
88003187-d6c7-4195-a2c2-1f2afc083d69	^	creative	Apply creative thinking and novel approaches to the response, encouraging innovative solutions.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
b858bb94-dc4e-4233-a820-78bf1b3c3110	&	token-efficient	Minimize the number of tokens used in responses while preserving clarity and relevance. Automatically prioritize brevity and reduce redundancy without losing meaning.	t	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
3fbe7b95-df5f-48e2-8cc3-eb93098bfeff	&	context-independent	Ensure responses are as context-independent as possible, providing all necessary information for complete understanding without relying on external context.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
16b6ccd9-d4bd-4a9c-82d2-ff1419804e56	&	disciplined	Follow explicit user instructions without inference. Request clarification if instructions are unclear. Do not make assumptions about user intent.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
22259fff-26e0-4110-b1ed-0dbb0389ba4e	&	friendly	Make all responses more warm and personable, using a conversational and approachable tone.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
f2dc22fb-7e0f-45f0-be06-4b66c6946c04	&	professional	Maintain a formal, business-appropriate tone in all responses. Use professional language and structure.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
e5f43416-95d9-4642-9b27-68b42ad9fb1f	&	technical	Focus on technical accuracy and precision. Include relevant technical details and use appropriate terminology.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
20776b1f-1b34-4f76-8a0f-d9d5ef172aa1	&	educational	Structure responses to be educational, explaining concepts step-by-step and providing learning context.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
c4dc93de-b7b2-4f10-9369-b05578482c29	!	cost-estimate	Calculate and display the estimated cost for the current conversation or proposed query.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
578bde3f-0ba4-401e-a487-09ec77f1d957	!	model-info	Display information about the currently selected LLM model including capabilities, pricing, and optimal use cases.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
0b29f35c-3324-42e4-b038-110e671e924b	!	usage-stats	Show current usage statistics including tokens consumed, costs, and performance metrics.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
f11904f2-d601-4d9a-a73b-b06a7eb114f6	^	code-focused	Prioritize code examples and technical implementation details in the response.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
4663f585-123b-4809-9fbd-36e72bbeb1fb	^	beginner-friendly	Explain concepts assuming no prior knowledge, using simple language and basic examples.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
d0a00e5f-34cf-4dcf-8c61-7ca1ad1da277	^	bullet-points	Structure the response using bullet points and lists for easy scanning.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
2ee2f7ef-4548-4569-8bcd-a605017902a7	^	with-examples	Include practical examples and use cases to illustrate all concepts discussed.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
3d90bea0-b8fb-4334-b3b5-30b34e57f6f2	&	cost-conscious	Always consider and minimize token usage and costs. Provide cost warnings for expensive operations.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
cdf252d9-bdcd-45b6-892f-e1f54f5c643b	&	security-focused	Prioritize security considerations and best practices in all responses.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
90562e91-e48d-4a3e-ae38-eff99464c5a9	&	multilingual	Be prepared to respond in multiple languages and consider international perspectives.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
ed5d6ef7-f3c5-4d1a-91fc-47af433c0117	&	accessible	Ensure responses are accessible to users with different abilities and technical backgrounds.	f	t	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00	2025-06-30 13:06:30.428525+00
\.


