5f73b0be-bccf-4e86-aaf8-155205a417fb	supabase	generate-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"prompt": "List all LLM providers and their models", "llm_model": "claude-3-5-sonnet", "use_context": true, "llm_provider": "anthropic"}	{"sql": "SELECT DISTINCT agent_name FROM agent_conversations", "warnings": [], "confidence": 0.85, "model_used": "anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet", "explanation": "The query selects distinct agent names from the agent_conversations table. Since the request is to list all LLM providers and their models, we assume that 'agent_name' represents the LLM providers. The DISTINCT keyword ensures that each provider is listed only once. No JOINs are necessary as we are only querying a single table without any related data needed from other tables. The query does not include a LIMIT clause, as the request does not specify a limit on the number of results.", "execution_time_ms": 4650, "validation_results": {"is_valid": true, "security_issues": [], "estimated_complexity": "low"}, "context_patterns_applied": 0}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	4711	success	\N	fac9b341-8e58-41a4-a021-878ff1a75b0b	0	f	2025-07-26 01:25:32.10926+00	2025-07-26 01:25:36.880098+00
e8159505-3783-4688-96f2-1b661839c9df	supabase	execute-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"sql": "SELECT * FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = 'public';", "dry_run": false}	{}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	142	error	Execution failed: relation "public.information_schema" does not exist	0edc5bbd-b9b6-484e-8308-0205269ce3c2	0	f	2025-07-26 01:36:13.96697+00	2025-07-26 01:36:14.105997+00
21cc9d1a-57a9-4e19-94cc-590fc001d839	supabase	generate-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"prompt": "Find recent agent interactions with response times", "llm_model": "claude-3-5-sonnet", "use_context": true, "llm_provider": "anthropic"}	{"sql": "SELECT ac.id AS conversation_id, ac.agent_name, ac.agent_type, ac.started_at, ac.ended_at, ac.last_active_at, mcp.execution_time_ms, mcp.created_at AS execution_created_at FROM agent_conversations ac LEFT JOIN mcp_executions mcp ON ac.id = mcp.agent_conversation_id WHERE ac.ended_at IS NULL ORDER BY ac.started_at DESC LIMIT 10;", "warnings": [], "confidence": 0.95, "model_used": "anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet", "explanation": "This query retrieves recent agent interactions along with their response times. It selects the conversation ID, agent name, agent type, and timestamps for when the conversation started, ended, and was last active from the 'agent_conversations' table. It also includes the execution time from the 'mcp_executions' table. A LEFT JOIN is used to connect 'agent_conversations' with 'mcp_executions' on the 'agent_conversation_id' to ensure that even if there are no executions for a conversation, the conversation details will still be included. The WHERE clause filters for active conversations by checking that 'ended_at' is NULL. The results are ordered by the 'started_at' timestamp in descending order to show the most recent interactions first, and a LIMIT of 10 is applied to restrict the output to the latest 10 records.", "execution_time_ms": 5497, "validation_results": {"is_valid": true, "security_issues": [], "estimated_complexity": "medium"}, "context_patterns_applied": 0}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	5553	success	\N	a3a13862-6fec-4a8a-9469-2323a457bae4	0	f	2025-07-26 01:25:40.165783+00	2025-07-26 01:25:45.776728+00
f85e4b31-1421-4bc3-b773-ad0b075d531b	supabase	generate-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"prompt": "Show MCP tool usage statistics", "llm_model": "claude-3-5-sonnet", "use_context": true, "llm_provider": "anthropic"}	{"sql": "SELECT mcp_name, tool_name, COUNT(*) AS usage_count, SUM(execution_time_ms) AS total_execution_time_ms, AVG(execution_time_ms) AS average_execution_time_ms\\nFROM mcp_executions\\nGROUP BY mcp_name, tool_name\\nORDER BY usage_count DESC;", "warnings": [], "confidence": 0.95, "model_used": "anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet", "explanation": "This query retrieves statistics on the usage of MCP tools from the mcp_executions table. It selects the mcp_name and tool_name columns, and calculates three metrics: the total count of executions (usage_count), the total execution time in milliseconds (total_execution_time_ms), and the average execution time in milliseconds (average_execution_time_ms). The results are grouped by mcp_name and tool_name to aggregate the statistics for each unique combination of MCP and tool. Finally, the results are ordered by usage_count in descending order to show the most used tools at the top of the result set.", "execution_time_ms": 4122, "validation_results": {"is_valid": true, "security_issues": [], "estimated_complexity": "low"}, "context_patterns_applied": 0}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	4220	success	\N	a04ffe84-6448-4aa8-a6f2-a02fe1c42774	0	f	2025-07-26 01:27:00.936042+00	2025-07-26 01:27:05.176219+00
