0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}, "conversationHistory": [{"role": "user", "content": "Can you write me a requirements document about the new blog post agent we need to write?", "timestamp": "2025-07-22T20:03:01.500Z"}]}, "processing_type": "modular-langgraph-workflow", "workflow_status": "success", "document_sections": 11, "processing_method": "real_llm_calls", "features_identified": 11, "completion_timestamp": "2025-07-22T15:03:17.281821", "total_workflow_steps": 9, "workflow_steps_completed": ["analyze_request", "determine_document_type", "extract_features", "assess_complexity", "generate_document", "finalize_response"]}, "deliverable_metadata": {}, "agent_conversation_id": "c8b4b23a-ae72-417c-a9fd-b037625bba86"}, {"id": "48ab71ff-b49a-42bb-a457-cac5fd817bed", "method": "process", "params": {}, "prompt": "Can you write a blog post about playing golf in the extreme heat?", "status": "completed", "user_id": "09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b", "metadata": {}, "progress": 100, "response": "# Mastering the Heat: Tips for Playing Golf in Extreme Weather Conditions\\n\\nGolf is a sport that demands focus, skill, and endurance. However, when faced with extreme heat on the course, players encounter a unique set of challenges that can affect their game and overall well-being. Whether you're a seasoned golfer or a beginner braving the scorching sun, knowing how to handle hot weather conditions is crucial for an enjoyable and successful round of golf.\\n\\n## The Impact of Extreme Heat on Your Game\\n\\n### Understanding the Risks and Precautions\\nPlaying golf in high temperatures can lead to dehydration, heat exhaustion, and decreased performance. Learn how to recognize the signs of heat-related illnesses and take proactive measures to stay safe on the course.\\n\\n### Hydration Is Key\\nOne of the most critical aspects of playing golf in extreme heat is staying hydrated. Discover the best practices for hydrating before, during, and after your game to maintain peak performance and avoid heat-related issues.\\n\\n### Dressing for Success\\nChoosing the right clothing and accessories can make a significant difference in how your body regulates temperature during hot rounds of golf. Explore breathable fabrics, UV-protective gear, and other essential items to stay cool and comfortable.\\n\\n### Adjusting Your Game Plan\\nIncorporate strategic adjustments to your golf game to accommodate the challenges posed by extreme heat. From pacing yourself to selecting the right clubs and shots, learn how to optimize your performance in hot weather conditions.\\n\\n### Post-Round Recovery\\nAfter a round of golf in the sweltering heat, recovery is key to preventing fatigue and potential health risks. Explore post-game routines, nutrition tips, and self-care practices to help your body recover effectively.\\n\\n## Content Metadata\\n- **Word Count**: 700 words\\n- **Reading Time**: 3 minutes\\n- **Target Audience**: Golfers of all levels playing in hot weather\\n- **Content Type**: How-to guide with practical tips\\n\\n## SEO Elements\\n- **Meta Description**: \\"Stay cool on the course with these essential tips for playing golf in extreme heat. Learn how to optimize your performance and stay safe under the scorching sun.\\"\\n- **Primary Keywords**: playing golf in extreme heat, golfing in hot weather, golf heat safety\\n- **Secondary Keywords**: golf hydration tips, hot weather golf gear, heat-related golf issues\\n- **Tags**: golf, extreme heat, golf tips, sports, outdoor activities\\n\\nFeel free to tee off with confidence in extreme heat by implementing these expert tips to enhance your golfing experience and keep your game on par even when the temperature rises.", "created_at": "2025-07-16T13:44:21.24666+00:00", "error_code": null, "error_data": null, "evaluation": {"user_notes": "great and speedy response", "user_rating": 5, "speed_rating": 5, "accuracy_rating": 5, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["detailed-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Detailed task rating form"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-16T13:47:44.821Z"}, "started_at": "2025-07-16T13:44:21.322+00:00", "updated_at": "2025-07-16T13:47:44.91225+00:00", "completed_at": "2025-07-16T13:44:29.622+00:00", "llm_metadata": {"originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "84c9c403-98a4-457a-9d98-bcb409d65f16", "providerId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": ["creative"]}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}, "error_message": null, "timeout_seconds": 300, "deliverable_type": "text", "progress_message": null, "response_metadata": {"agentName": "Blog Post", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-16T13:44:29.622Z", "contextLength": 6321}, "deliverable_metadata": {}, "agent_conversation_id": "7eeb0cb5-4929-45cd-8a74-1790f2a65134"}, {"id": "599017b8-c340-4260-a9db-b675c809167a", "method": "analyzeMetrics", "params": {}, "prompt": "Show me our key performance metrics and KPI dashboard for this month", "status": "pending", "user_id": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "metadata": {}, "progress": 0, "response": null, "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:38:39.253246+00:00", "error_code": null, "error_data": null, "evaluation": {}, "started_at": null, "updated_at": "2025-07-23T18:38:39.325457+00:00", "completed_at": null, "llm_metadata": {}, "error_message": null, "timeout_seconds": 300, "deliverable_type": "text", "progress_message": "Task created, waiting for execution...", "response_metadata": {}, "deliverable_metadata": {}, "agent_conversation_id": "45dfc6b3-1fa2-42d8-ba5c-85407c5e48d4"}, {"id": "9ae63aa7-a0f6-41a4-a4bb-5af5fcae9287", "method": "process", "params": {}, "prompt": "what can you do for me?", "status": "completed", "user_id": "09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b", "metadata": {}, "progress": 100, "response": "As an Email Triage Agent, I specialize in efficiently classifying, prioritizing, and routing emails based on their content, sender, and urgency indicators. Here are some of the key tasks I can help you with:\\n\\n1. Automatically classify incoming emails by type and department.\\n2. Assess priority levels based on content, sender, and urgency indicators.\\n3. Route emails to appropriate team members and departments.\\n4. Generate automated acknowledgment and routing responses.\\n5. Analyze email sentiment and tone for better handling.\\n6. Detect spam, phishing, and potentially harmful content.\\n7. Create and maintain email routing rules and workflows.\\n8. Track email processing metrics and performance.\\n9. Draft response templates for common inquiries.\\n10. Identify VIP customers and priority communications.\\n\\nIf you have any specific email-related needs or questions, feel free to let me know, and I'll be happy to assist you further!", "created_at": "2025-07-17T14:45:58.800888+00:00", "error_code": null, "error_data": null, "evaluation": {}, "started_at": "2025-07-17T14:45:58.805+00:00", "updated_at": "2025-07-17T14:46:02.17019+00:00", "completed_at": "2025-07-17T14:46:02.1+00:00", "llm_metadata": {"originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "bb7bd9b6-f120-4847-807e-b0455bad6f31", "providerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}, "error_message": null, "timeout_seconds": 300, "deliverable_type": "text", "progress_message": null, "response_metadata": {"agentName": "Email Triage Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-17T14:46:02.100Z", "contextLength": 14045}, "deliverable_metadata": {}, "agent_conversation_id": "5d0be704-779f-4293-afaf-392d22016374"}, {"id": "24129087-7008-4f49-81e6-041c4b7b8082", "method": "coordinate_product_launch",