82ed3a66-b997-4a28-9119-c902de3c64b6	supabase	generate-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"prompt": "Find all agents that have been running for more than 24 hours without completing any tasks, along with their last activity time", "use_context": true}	{"sql": "SELECT ac.agent_name, ac.last_active_at FROM agent_conversations ac LEFT JOIN tasks t ON ac.id = t.agent_conversation_id WHERE ac.ended_at IS NULL AND (NOW() - ac.started_at) > INTERVAL '24 hours' AND t.id IS NULL LIMIT 100;", "warnings": [], "confidence": 0.95, "model_used": "anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet", "explanation": "1. We start by selecting the `agent_name` and `last_active_at` from the `agent_conversations` table (aliased as `ac`).  \\n2. We perform a LEFT JOIN with the `tasks` table (aliased as `t`) on the condition that the `id` of `agent_conversations` matches the `agent_conversation_id` in `tasks`. This allows us to include all agent conversations even if they have no associated tasks.  \\n3. We filter the results with the condition `ac.ended_at IS NULL` to ensure we only consider active conversations.  \\n4. We add another condition to check if the difference between the current time (`NOW()`) and the `started_at` time of the conversation is greater than 24 hours using the `INTERVAL '24 hours'` syntax.  \\n5. We also check that there are no tasks associated with these conversations by ensuring `t.id IS NULL`.  \\n6. Finally, we limit the results to 100 entries to avoid large result sets.  \\nThis query effectively retrieves all agents that have been active for more than 24 hours without completing any tasks, along with their last activity time.", "execution_time_ms": 7800, "validation_results": {"is_valid": true, "security_issues": [], "estimated_complexity": "medium"}, "context_patterns_applied": 0}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	7873	success	\N	bae798ea-1054-443c-a955-2c0aa32ccd8f	0	f	2025-07-26 02:18:54.633357+00	2025-07-26 02:19:02.54537+00
de0b4e98-5035-402e-a716-0e4894a53c95	supabase	execute-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"sql": "SELECT ac.agent_name, ac.last_active_at FROM agent_conversations ac LEFT JOIN tasks t ON ac.id = t.agent_conversation_id WHERE ac.ended_at IS NULL AND (NOW() - ac.started_at) > INTERVAL '24 hours' AND t.id IS NULL LIMIT 100;", "dry_run": false}	{}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	133	error	Execution failed: "failed to parse select parameter (ac.agent_name,ac.last_active_at)" (line 1, column 4)	0b8c1d7e-ddb5-47b6-8d20-a55c8e225619	0	f	2025-07-26 02:19:02.619975+00	2025-07-26 02:19:02.744551+00
d6080ac2-5696-490d-869a-9d450ea9eadd	supabase	generate-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"prompt": "Calculate the average response time of MCP tools grouped by provider, but only for the last 30 days and exclude any executions that failed", "use_context": true}	{"sql": "SELECT mcp_name, tool_name, AVG(execution_time_ms) AS average_response_time\\nFROM mcp_executions\\nWHERE created_at >= NOW() - INTERVAL '30 days'\\nAND status != 'failed'\\nGROUP BY mcp_name, tool_name\\nORDER BY mcp_name, tool_name;", "warnings": [], "confidence": 0.95, "model_used": "anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet", "explanation": "1. The query selects the `mcp_name` and `tool_name` columns from the `mcp_executions` table. 2. It calculates the average execution time in milliseconds using the `AVG(execution_time_ms)` function. 3. The `WHERE` clause filters the records to include only those created in the last 30 days by checking if `created_at` is greater than or equal to the current date minus 30 days. 4. It also excludes any executions that have a status of 'failed' by ensuring `status != 'failed'`. 5. The results are grouped by `mcp_name` and `tool_name` to calculate the average response time for each combination. 6. Finally, the results are ordered by `mcp_name` and `tool_name` for better readability. 7. The query is designed to be efficient and secure, following best practices for SQL queries.", "execution_time_ms": 9537, "validation_results": {"is_valid": true, "security_issues": [], "estimated_complexity": "low"}, "context_patterns_applied": 0}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	9631	success	\N	33900e80-77de-450d-8248-e52b1f934c89	0	f	2025-07-26 02:19:02.942702+00	2025-07-26 02:19:12.615966+00
