b478b073-9117-4399-9aaf-40f7ca45d068	supabase	generate-sql	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	\N	\N	{"prompt": "Show me revenue trends for the past 12 months", "query_type": "SELECT", "schema_tables": ["kpi_data"], "include_explanation": true}	{"sql": "SELECT companies.name, SUM(value) as total_revenue FROM companies JOIN departments ON companies.id = departments.company_id JOIN kpi_data ON departments.id = kpi_data.department_id JOIN kpi_metrics ON kpi_data.metric_id = kpi_metrics.id WHERE kpi_metrics.name = 'Monthly Revenue' AND kpi_data.date_recorded >= NOW() - INTERVAL '12 months' GROUP BY companies.id, companies.name ORDER BY total_revenue DESC LIMIT 100", "warnings": [], "confidence": 0.95, "model_used": "anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet", "explanation": "This query retrieves the total revenue for each company over the past 12 months, specifically focusing on the 'Monthly Revenue' metric. It follows the Supabase constraints by using full table names in the SELECT clause without aliases, ensuring that all joins are simple and direct. The query starts by selecting the company names and the sum of their revenue values from the 'kpi_data' table. It joins the 'companies' table with 'departments' to link each department to its respective company, and then joins 'kpi_data' to access the actual revenue values recorded for each department. The 'kpi_metrics' table is joined to filter the results specifically for the 'Monthly Revenue' metric. The date filter ensures that only records from the last 12 months are included. The results are grouped by company ID and name to aggregate the revenue per company, and they are ordered by total revenue in descending order to highlight the highest revenue-generating companies. Finally, a LIMIT of 100 is applied to ensure the query remains safe and efficient.", "execution_time_ms": 5559, "validation_results": {"is_valid": true, "security_issues": [], "estimated_complexity": "medium"}, "context_patterns_applied": 1}	anthropic	claude-3-5-sonnet	5690	success	\N	64918650-bf00-4544-a9a3-2db18c1de8d5	0	f	2025-07-29 12:56:41.252825+00	2025-07-29 12:56:46.888907+00
