1fc947d2-f82e-4cfa-897c-ce37cf23fcd8	4dbc2415-806f-4b0c-ad73-2b9cede63ff8	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain?	{}	\N	{}	failed	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-30T15:08:16.755Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	Hiverarchy authentication failed: No access token received from Hiverarchy	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-30 15:08:16.865526+00	2025-07-30 15:08:17.343115+00	text	{}
d1b3e949-309c-4ba3-8cd3-8b37b2fcb645	76bfb32e-0519-4bd8-b68c-167c9872a758	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you help me write a requirements document that discusses enhancing our deliverables discovery?	{}	{"success":true,"message":"**🤖 Requirements Writer Agent**\\n\\n# Product Requirements Document (PRD)\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\nThe purpose of this PRD is to outline the requirements for enhancing deliverables discovery within our platform. By implementing features such as improved search functionality, data analysis tools, customizable filters, and role-based access control, we aim to provide users with a more efficient and personalized experience. This initiative aligns with our goal of improving user satisfaction and engagement, ultimately driving business growth and success.\\n\\n## 2. Product Overview\\n### Goals:\\n- Enhance deliverables discovery within the platform\\n- Improve user experience and engagement\\n- Increase user satisfaction and retention\\n- Drive business growth through improved functionality\\n\\n### Objectives:\\n- Implement search functionality to enable users to easily find relevant deliverables\\n- Integrate data analysis tools to provide insights and enhance decision-making\\n- Enhance the search interface for a more intuitive user experience\\n- Enable customizable filters to tailor search results to user preferences\\n- Integrate external data sources for enriched content\\n- Implement role-based access control for enhanced security and user management\\n\\n### Success Metrics:\\n- Increase in user engagement metrics (e.g., time spent on platform, frequency of searches)\\n- Improvement in user satisfaction scores based on feedback and surveys\\n- Increase in the number of active users utilizing the new features\\n- Reduction in user complaints related to deliverables discovery\\n\\n## 3. User Personas & Use Cases\\n### User Personas:\\n1. **Research Analyst Rachel:** Relies on quick access to relevant deliverables for market research.\\n2. **Project Manager Peter:** Needs to analyze project data efficiently and collaborate with team members.\\n3. **Administrator Alex:** Responsible for managing user access and security within the platform.\\n\\n### Use Cases:\\n1. Rachel searches for industry reports using customized filters.\\n2. Peter analyzes project data using data analysis tools.\\n3. Alex assigns access levels to different user roles.\\n\\n## 4. Functional Requirements\\n1. **Deliverables Discovery Enhancement:**\\n   - Implement advanced search functionality with keyword and category filters.\\n   - Enable sorting options based on relevance, date, and popularity.\\n   \\n2. **Search Functionality:**\\n   - Integrate a robust search engine for quick and accurate results.\\n   - Provide autocomplete suggestions for search queries.\\n   \\n3. **Data Analysis Tools:**\\n   - Include data visualization tools for better insights.\\n   - Enable exporting of analyzed data for further processing.\\n   \\n4. **Improved Search Interface:**\\n   - Redesign search interface for a more user-friendly experience.\\n   - Implement a responsive design for seamless access across devices.\\n   \\n5. **Customizable Filters:**\\n   - Allow users to set preferences for search results.\\n   - Enable saving of custom filter settings for future use.\\n   \\n6. **External Data Sources:**\\n   - Integrate APIs for accessing external data sources.\\n   - Ensure data security and compliance with external sources.\\n   \\n7. **Role-based Access Control:**\\n   - Implement user roles with specific access permissions.\\n   - Enable administrators to manage user roles and permissions.\\n\\n## 5. User Stories\\n1. As a Research Analyst, I want to easily search for industry reports by keywords to save time.\\n2. As a Project Manager, I want to visualize project data using charts and graphs for better decision-making.\\n3. As an Administrator, I want to assign different access levels to users based on their roles to maintain security.\\n\\n## 6. Non-Functional Requirements\\n- **Performance:** Ensure fast search results and minimal latency.\\n- **Security:** Implement data encryption and secure user authentication.\\n- **Scalability:** Design the system to handle increased user traffic and data volume.\\n\\n## 7. Technical Considerations\\n- **Backend:** Utilize robust search algorithms and data processing frameworks.\\n- **Frontend:** Implement responsive design using modern UI frameworks.\\n- **Integration:** Integrate with external APIs securely and efficiently.\\n\\n## 8. Implementation Timeline\\n### Phase 1: Planning and Design\\n- Define requirements and user stories\\n- Create wireframes and UI mockups\\n\\n### Phase 2: Development\\n- Implement search functionality and filters\\n- Integrate data analysis tools and external data sources\\n\\n### Phase 3: Testing and Deployment\\n- Conduct extensive testing for functionality and performance\\n- Deploy features in a phased approach to ensure stability\\n\\n## 9. Success Metrics\\n- **KPIs:** Increase in user engagement by 20%\\n- **Measurement Criteria:** User feedback surveys, usage analytics\\n- **User Adoption:** 80% of active users utilize the new features within 3 months\\n\\n## 10. Risk Assessment\\n### Potential Challenges:\\n- Integration complexity with external data sources\\n- Ensuring data security and compliance with external APIs\\n- User adoption and training for new features\\n\\n### Mitigation Strategies:\\n- Conduct thorough testing of external integrations\\n- Implement data encryption and access controls for security\\n- Provide user training sessions and documentation for feature adoption\\n\\nBy following this comprehensive PRD, we aim to successfully enhance our deliverables discovery functionality and provide users with a more efficient and personalized experience, ultimately driving business growth and success.","action":"DELEGATE","agentName":"requirements_writer","metadata":{"agentType":"specialist","agentName":"requirements_writer","processedAt":"2025-08-06T13:49:39.078Z","delegatedAgent":"requirements_writer","delegatedAt":"2025-08-06T13:49:39.078Z","executionType":"python_script","scriptPath":"/Users/golfergeek/projects/golfergeek/orchestrator-ai/apps/api/src/agents/actual/engineering/requirements_writer/agent-function.py","method":"executeTask","originalParams":{"prompt":"Can you help me write a requirements document that discusses enhancing our deliverables discovery?","userId":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","conversationId":"","conversationHistory":[{"role":"assistant","content":"Hello! I'm the Engineering Manager Orchestrator. How can I help you today?","timestamp":"2025-08-06T13:49:10.864Z","metadata":{"isWelcome":true}},{"role":"user","content":"Can you help me write a requirements document that discusses enhancing our deliverables discovery?","timestamp":"2025-08-06T13:49:15.806Z"}],"metadata":{"delegatedBy":"orchestrator","delegatedAt":"2025-08-06T13:49:19.524Z","targetAgent":"requirements_writer","agentType":"orchestrator","method":"processTask","agentName":"engineering_manager_orchestrator"}},"timestamp":"2025-08-06T13:49:19.524Z","llmPreferences":{}},"conversationId":"","userId":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b"}	{}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-08-06T13:49:15.965Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-08-06 13:49:16.034251+00	2025-08-06 13:49:39.195847+00	text	{}
8dd49bcc-eaa8-478d-94d9-0dce5309d74d	e043c373-f82d-47d9-9b63-b38e36f67349	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you create a standard operating procedure for writing a new software module using the most modern AI principles of small teams, rapid development, AI assistance with documentation, etc.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"Absolutely! Developing a standard operating procedure (SOP) for writing a new software module utilizing modern AI principles and practices is crucial for ensuring consistency and efficiency within your team. Below is a comprehensive SOP tailored to address this specific process:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Title: Software Module Development Procedure with Modern AI Principles\\n\\n### Purpose:\\nThe purpose of this SOP is to outline the standardized process for developing a new software module using modern AI principles, fostering collaboration within small teams, promoting rapid development, and leveraging AI tools for documentation assistance.\\n\\n### Scope:\\nThis procedure applies to all team members involved in the development of software modules within the organization, emphasizing the integration of AI technologies and best practices for efficient and effective module creation.\\n\\n### Responsibilities:\\n1. **Project Manager:**\\n   - Oversee the software module development process.\\n   - Ensure adherence to timelines and quality standards.\\n   \\n2. **Developers:**\\n   - Implement AI-enhanced coding practices.\\n   - Collaborate closely with team members for seamless integration.\\n   \\n3. **AI Specialist:**\\n   - Provide expertise on AI tools and technologies.\\n   - Support the team in leveraging AI for documentation tasks.\\n\\n### Procedures:\\n\\n1. **Planning Phase:**\\n   - Define module requirements and objectives.\\n   - Identify AI components and tools to be utilized.\\n\\n2. **Development Phase:**\\n   - Assign specific tasks to team members based on expertise.\\n   - Implement agile development methodologies for rapid iteration.\\n   - Integrate AI for code generation and optimization.\\n   \\n3. **Testing and Validation:**\\n   - Conduct rigorous testing to ensure module functionality.\\n   - Utilize AI for automated testing and quality assurance.\\n   - Gather feedback from stakeholders for continuous improvement.\\n\\n4. **Documentation:**\\n   - Utilize AI-driven tools for automated documentation generation.\\n   - Ensure clear and detailed documentation for future reference.\\n   - Regularly update documentation to reflect changes.\\n\\n5. **Deployment and Monitoring:**\\n   - Deploy the software module in a controlled environment.\\n   - Monitor performance using AI-based analytics.\\n   - Collect user feedback for further enhancements.\\n\\n### Resources:\\n- AI tools for code generation and documentation.\\n- Collaboration platforms for team communication.\\n- Testing frameworks for quality assurance.\\n\\n### Quality Control:\\n- Regular code reviews and peer feedback.\\n- Automated testing for functional and non-functional requirements.\\n- Documentation accuracy checks using AI-assisted tools.\\n\\n### Review Schedule:\\n- Quarterly review of AI tools and practices effectiveness.\\n- Bi-weekly team retrospectives for process improvement.\\n\\n---\\nThis SOP provides a structured framework for your team to follow when developing software modules using modern AI principles. Feel free to customize this SOP to align with your specific team dynamics and organizational requirements.\\n\\nLet me know if you need further assistance or more detailed information on any specific section of this SOP!","metadata":{"agentName":"SOP Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":6853,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T16:19:06.814Z"}}	{"agentName": "SOP Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T16:19:06.814Z", "contextLength": 6853}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{"user_rating": 5, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["positive", "quick-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Quick positive rating"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-29T16:28:27.708Z"}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T16:18:55.616Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 16:19:06.815+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 16:18:55.659702+00	2025-07-29 16:28:27.764159+00	text	{}
d6aa71e1-deb9-488f-9137-57500b4510b9	c1d69099-c156-4013-9932-58b79c662072	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Conduct a comprehensive competitive analysis comparing Orchestrator AI against the top 3 competitors in the AI automation platform space. Include positioning, pricing, strengths/weaknesses, and strategic recommendations.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"### Competitive Analysis: Orchestrator AI vs. Top Competitors in AI Automation Platform Space\\n\\n#### **1. Orchestrator AI - The Intelligent Orchestration Leader**\\n\\n**Positioning**:\\n- **Market Focus**: AI-driven multi-agent coordination for complex business processes.\\n- **Strengths**:\\n  - **Sophisticated Agent Communication**: Enables intelligent task delegation.\\n  - **Context Preservation**: Advanced context awareness for seamless workflows.\\n  - **AI Model Integration**: Multiple AI language models for diverse tasks.\\n- **Weaknesses**:\\n  - **Limited Enterprise Adoption**: Smaller partner ecosystem and brand recognition.\\n  - **High Complexity**: Deep learning curve for non-technical users.\\n\\n**Pricing**:\\n- **Model**: Subscription-based pricing at $99 per user/month.\\n- **Value Proposition**: Premium pricing justified by advanced AI capabilities.\\n\\n#### **2. Competitor A - The Enterprise Automation Titan**\\n\\n**Positioning**:\\n- **Market Focus**: Comprehensive enterprise solutions with extensive integration capabilities.\\n- **Strengths**:\\n  - **Established Enterprise Relationships**: Trusted by large enterprises.\\n  - **Compliance Certifications**: Meeting industry standards.\\n- **Weaknesses**:\\n  - **Complexity**: Long implementation cycles and high total cost of ownership.\\n  - **Limited Brand Recognition**: Struggles with brand awareness in emerging markets.\\n\\n**Pricing**:\\n- **Model**: Enterprise licensing models ranging from $50-500+ per user/month.\\n\\n#### **3. Competitor B - The AI-First Innovator**\\n\\n**Positioning**:\\n- **Market Focus**: Native AI integration with modern development approaches.\\n- **Strengths**:\\n  - **Developer-Friendly**: Appeals to technical organizations.\\n  - **AI-Native Features**: Built-from-ground-up AI-first platform design.\\n- **Weaknesses**:\\n  - **Limited Enterprise Adoption**: Struggles with enterprise feature parity.\\n  - **Small Partner Ecosystem**: Challenges in building a robust partner network.\\n\\n**Pricing**:\\n- **Model**: API-based pricing models at $10-50 per user/month.\\n\\n#### **4. Competitor C - The Conversational AI Specialist**\\n\\n**Positioning**:\\n- **Market Focus**: General-purpose AI assistants with growing automation capabilities.\\n- **Strengths**:\\n  - **Advanced AI Capabilities**: Extensive model capabilities and brand recognition.\\n  - **AI Model Depth**: Offers a wide range of functionalities for various tasks.\\n- **Weaknesses**:\\n  - **Limited Business Integration**: Generic solutions without specialized workflows.\\n  - **Basic Automation Features**: Lacks specialized automation capabilities.\\n\\n**Pricing**:\\n- **Model**: API usage-based models priced at $20-30 per user/month.\\n\\n### Strategic Recommendations\\n\\n#### **For Orchestrator AI (Defensive Strategy)**\\n1. **Enhance Enterprise Adoption**: Focus on building a stronger partner ecosystem and increasing brand recognition.\\n2. **Simplify User Experience**: Reduce complexity to appeal to non-technical users.\\n3. **Expand AI Model Integration**: Integrate more AI language models for diverse tasks.\\n4. **Vertical Specialization**: Develop industry-specific solutions for deeper market penetration.\\n\\n#### **For Competitor A (Offensive Strategy)**\\n1. **Improve Brand Awareness**: Invest in marketing to enhance brand recognition.\\n2. **Accelerate Innovation**: Reduce implementation cycles and total cost of ownership.\\n3. **Develop Partner Ecosystem**: Strengthen relationships with partners for broader reach.\\n4. **Enhance Compliance**: Obtain additional compliance certifications for increased credibility.\\n\\n#### **For Competitor B (Innovation Strategy)**\\n1. **Focus on Enterprise Features**: Accelerate development of enterprise capabilities for wider adoption.\\n2. **Expand Partner Network**: Build a robust partner ecosystem to drive growth.\\n3. **Differentiate with AI-Native Features**: Emphasize the AI-first design for competitive advantage.\\n4. **Improve Brand Visibility**: Increase marketing efforts to boost brand recognition.\\n\\n#### **For Competitor C (Specialization Strategy)**\\n1. **Enhance Business Integration**: Develop specialized automation capabilities for targeted industries.\\n2. **Customize AI Capabilities**: Tailor AI functionalities to meet specific business needs.\\n3. **Diversify Automation Offerings**: Expand automation features to cover a broader range of tasks.\\n4. **Strengthen Market Positioning**: Focus on unique value propositions to differentiate from competitors.\\n\\n### Summary\\nThis analysis provides an overview of Orchestrator AI and its key competitors in the AI automation platform space, highlighting their positions, pricing strategies, strengths, weaknesses, and strategic recommendations for each. By understanding the competitive landscape and strategic opportunities, Orchestrator AI can refine its positioning and offerings to maintain a competitive edge in the market.","metadata":{"agentName":"Competitors Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":28868,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T17:14:07.935Z"}}	{"agentName": "Competitors Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T17:14:07.935Z", "contextLength": 28868}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 17:14:07.935+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 17:13:49.61096+00	2025-07-29 17:14:08.131878+00	text	{}
