de8922b8-24ee-4afa-9240-0a3324be5e19	9e69edcb-fc40-45ef-91a6-973977df351c	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	orchestrate	Can you write me a requirements document for a mobile app that helps golfers track their handicap and improve their game?	{}	\N	{}	pending	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-29 23:02:54.915903+00	2025-07-29 23:02:55.114162+00	text	{}
cdf9b07a-055d-4a39-a5ba-3d128f14674d	17edc9ad-3b4e-4b30-be04-5afd43b2f088	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	process	I hit my ball into a water hazard marked with yellow stakes. What should I do and what penalty do I get?	{}	{"response":"If your ball enters a water hazard marked with yellow stakes, here’s what to do and the associated penalty:\\n\\n1. **Penalty**: You incur a one-stroke penalty.\\n\\n2. **Options for Relief**:\\n   - **Replay from Original Position**: You can replay your shot from the original spot where you last played the ball, adding one stroke to your score.\\n   \\n   - **Drop Behind the Hazard**: Alternatively, you can drop a ball behind the water hazard. You must keep the point where the ball last crossed the margin of the hazard directly between the hole and where you drop the ball. There is no limit to how far back on that line you can go, and this option also incurs a one-stroke penalty.\\n\\nChoose one of these options to continue your play after hitting into the water hazard.","rawApiResponse":{"output":"If your ball enters a water hazard marked with yellow stakes, here’s what to do and the associated penalty:\\n\\n1. **Penalty**: You incur a one-stroke penalty.\\n\\n2. **Options for Relief**:\\n   - **Replay from Original Position**: You can replay your shot from the original spot where you last played the ball, adding one stroke to your score.\\n   \\n   - **Drop Behind the Hazard**: Alternatively, you can drop a ball behind the water hazard. You must keep the point where the ball last crossed the margin of the hazard directly between the hole and where you drop the ball. There is no limit to how far back on that line you can go, and this option also incurs a one-stroke penalty.\\n\\nChoose one of these options to continue your play after hitting into the water hazard."},"metadata":{"statusCode":200,"attempt":1,"responseTime":1753793924780}}	{"taskId": "cdf9b07a-055d-4a39-a5ba-3d128f14674d", "userId": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "attempt": 1, "agentName": "Rules Of Golf Agent", "agentType": "engineering", "apiStatus": "executed", "statusCode": 200, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T12:58:44.780Z", "responseTime": 1753793924780}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 12:58:44.78+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 12:58:34.065254+00	2025-07-29 12:58:44.905129+00	text	{}
