6aac2f6c-b9f7-4f7f-9945-19f1a45bab59	098389a4-5325-4411-a61f-477d2f93d480	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Hello, can you help me with onboarding information?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"Of course, I'd be happy to assist you with onboarding information! Onboarding is the process through which new employees receive the necessary information, tools, and resources to become acclimated to the company and their new role.\\n\\nThe onboarding policy exists to ensure that new employees have a smooth transition into the organization, understand their roles and responsibilities, and feel welcomed and supported. This process helps to set clear expectations, align new employees with the company culture, and provide them with the necessary training to succeed in their positions.\\n\\nHere are some specific steps you should follow during the onboarding process:\\n1. Complete all required paperwork and documentation as provided by the HR department.\\n2. Participate in orientation sessions to learn about company policies, benefits, and procedures.\\n3. Meet with your manager to discuss job expectations, goals, and performance metrics.\\n4. Engage in any training programs or on-the-job learning activities as required for your role.\\n\\nDuring the onboarding process, you can expect to receive information about the company's mission, values, and culture, as well as details about your benefits package, work schedule, and any relevant training or development opportunities.\\n\\nIf you have any questions or need additional support during the onboarding process, please don't hesitate to reach out to your HR representative or directly contact me, and I'll be more than happy to assist you every step of the way. Welcome aboard!","metadata":{"agentType":"specialist","functionStatus":"executed","processedAt":"2025-08-06T01:33:01.926Z","method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"executeTask","prompt":"Hello, can you help me with onboarding information?","taskId":"6aac2f6c-b9f7-4f7f-9945-19f1a45bab59","currentUser":{"id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-08-06T01:32:56.435Z","createdAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.557Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-06T01:32:56.437Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"bd517515-cb47-40de-ae10-5ac590c1c29e","id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","user_id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","identity_data":{"email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566752Z","created_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com"}]},"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..-9dZaFy76CiCvdAmRK6IciZ7FHbKwWZAROpOjLZvZYY","conversationHistory":[]},"agentName":"hr-assistant","timestamp":"2025-08-06T01:32:57.153Z","taskId":"6aac2f6c-b9f7-4f7f-9945-19f1a45bab59","processingType":"langgraph-workflow","processingTime":4580,"toolsUsed":["llm-service","langgraph"],"responseType":"hr-assistance","workflow":{"workflow_id":"hr_1754443977155","sessionId":"unknown","steps_completed":["classification","response_generation"],"classification_step":"completed","query_type":"policy","response_step":"completed","complexity_level":"simple","sensitive_topic":false,"workflow_status":"completed","total_steps":2}}}	{"taskId": "6aac2f6c-b9f7-4f7f-9945-19f1a45bab59", "userId": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "workflow": {"sessionId": "unknown", "query_type": "policy", "total_steps": 2, "workflow_id": "hr_1754443977155", "response_step": "completed", "sensitive_topic": false, "steps_completed": ["classification", "response_generation"], "workflow_status": "completed", "complexity_level": "simple", "classification_step": "completed"}, "agentName": "HR Assistant", "agentType": "specialist", "toolsUsed": ["llm-service", "langgraph"], "userEmail": "testuser@golfergeek.com", "totalSteps": 2, "processedAt": "2025-08-06T01:33:01.735Z", "responseType": "hr-assistance", "processingTime": 4580, "processingType": "langgraph-workflow", "workflowStepsCompleted": ["Classifying HR query", "Generating HR response", "Task execution completed"]}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-06 01:33:01.736+00	300	{}	2025-08-06 01:32:56.90908+00	2025-08-06 01:33:02.040602+00	text	{}
403b7344-7d10-487c-b627-3c5582cf01e9	b99c36be-8dd0-4f24-9f12-f835f8dcb159	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Create compelling marketing copy for our new AI product landing page. Include a powerful headline and benefit-focused subheadings.	{}	\N	{}	pending	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-08-05 14:48:27.766265+00	2025-08-05 14:48:27.972391+00	text	{}
da51e8e4-c793-4fcb-919d-9107a9d95d5f	5f0c8136-81e5-4e89-899d-ecb0d024c2a3	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	I just hit my ball out past the white stakes. What does that mean, and what should I do?	{}	{"response":"Hitting your ball out past the white stakes means you have hit your ball out of bounds. Here's what you need to do:\\n\\n1. **Penalty**: You incur a one-stroke penalty for hitting out of bounds.\\n\\n2. **Stroke and Distance**: You must play a new ball from the spot where you last played your previous shot. This means you will add one stroke to your score and hit a new ball from the original location where your last stroke was made.\\n\\nIn summary, you will replay the shot from the last location where you hit the ball and incur an additional penalty stroke.","rawApiResponse":{"output":"Hitting your ball out past the white stakes means you have hit your ball out of bounds. Here's what you need to do:\\n\\n1. **Penalty**: You incur a one-stroke penalty for hitting out of bounds.\\n\\n2. **Stroke and Distance**: You must play a new ball from the spot where you last played your previous shot. This means you will add one stroke to your score and hit a new ball from the original location where your last stroke was made.\\n\\nIn summary, you will replay the shot from the last location where you hit the ball and incur an additional penalty stroke."},"metadata":{"statusCode":200,"attempt":1,"responseTime":1753794065838}}	{"taskId": "da51e8e4-c793-4fcb-919d-9107a9d95d5f", "userId": "09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b", "attempt": 1, "agentName": "Rules Of Golf Agent", "agentType": "engineering", "apiStatus": "executed", "statusCode": 200, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T13:01:05.839Z", "responseTime": 1753794065838}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{"user_notes": "not bad!", "user_rating": 5, "speed_rating": 4, "accuracy_rating": 3, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["detailed-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Detailed task rating form"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-29T13:02:33.934Z"}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T13:00:57.278Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 13:01:05.839+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 13:00:57.355324+00	2025-07-29 13:02:34.009099+00	text	{}
afba2b98-a5e7-4252-8b2f-42da313d37af	e9ba64a7-ee59-4034-b6d6-caa1ee5b0ea2	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Create a social media campaign for the introduction to small businesses to Orchestrator AI, which will help them with a turnkey solution to build agents, evaluate agents, and compete with larger companies in the AI space.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"### Social Media Campaign: Orchestrator AI Introduction for Small Businesses\\n\\n**Campaign Objective:** \\nIntroduce Orchestrator AI to small businesses as a turnkey solution for building and evaluating AI agents, empowering them to compete with larger companies in the AI space.\\n\\n**Campaign Theme:** \\n\\"Empower Your Small Business with AI: Orchestrator AI's Turnkey Solution\\"\\n\\n**Campaign Duration:** \\n30 days\\n\\n**Content Strategy:**\\n\\n**Week 1: Awareness**\\n- **Social Media Posts (LinkedIn, Twitter, Facebook)**\\n   - Highlight the benefits of AI for small businesses\\n   - Tease Orchestrator AI's upcoming solution launch\\n   - Use engaging visuals and industry stats\\n\\n**Week 2: Product Showcase**\\n- **Social Media Posts**\\n   - Introduce Orchestrator AI's features: agent building, evaluation tools\\n   - Share customer success stories or testimonials\\n   - Create short explainer videos or infographics\\n\\n**Week 3: Compete with Confidence**\\n- **Social Media Posts**\\n   - Showcase how Orchestrator AI helps small businesses compete with industry giants\\n   - Highlight competitive advantages and use cases\\n   - Run a social media contest or poll related to AI\\n\\n**Week 4: Call-to-Action**\\n- **Social Media Posts**\\n   - Offer a limited-time trial or demo opportunity\\n   - Encourage small businesses to take the next step\\n   - Use compelling CTAs and urgency elements\\n\\n**Content Examples:**\\n\\n1. **Social Post:**\\n   - *Caption:* \\"Unlock the Power of AI for Your Small Business with Orchestrator AI! Build, evaluate, and compete like never before. #AIforSmallBiz #OrchestratorAI\\"\\n   - *Visual:* Eye-catching graphic showcasing AI agents and small business logos\\n\\n2. **Video:**\\n   - *Script:* \\"Meet Orchestrator AI - Your All-in-One Solution to Elevate Your Small Business in the AI Arena. Watch how our tools can transform your operations!\\"\\n\\n3. **Testimonial Post:**\\n   - *Caption:* \\"See How Orchestrator AI Transformed [Customer Name]'s Small Business. Join the AI Revolution Today! #OrchestratorSuccess #SmallBizAI\\"\\n\\n**Key Messaging:**\\n- Turnkey AI solution for small businesses\\n- Build and evaluate AI agents effortlessly\\n- Competitive edge against larger companies\\n- Empowering small businesses in the AI space\\n\\n**Call-to-Action (CTA):**\\n\\"Ready to Elevate Your Small Business with AI? Learn More about Orchestrator AI's Turnkey Solution Today! #SmallBizAI #OrchestratorAI\\"\\n\\n**Metrics to Track:**\\n- Engagement rates (likes, shares, comments)\\n- Click-through rates on CTA links\\n- Conversion rates for trial sign-ups or demo requests\\n\\nThis social media campaign will create awareness, showcase Orchestrator AI's benefits, and drive small businesses towards adopting AI to compete effectively in the industry. Let me know if you need further details or adjustments!","metadata":{"agentName":"Content Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":12913,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T17:26:35.654Z"}}	{"agentName": "Content Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T17:26:35.654Z", "contextLength": 12913}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{"user_rating": 5, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["positive", "quick-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Quick positive rating"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-29T17:27:16.725Z"}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T17:26:29.420Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 17:26:35.655+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 17:26:29.463784+00	2025-07-29 17:27:16.77661+00	text	{}
54d97c49-cee4-4b80-bfe9-56bccabe2714	255be187-7e5c-47df-8f4e-1e121f6b0dec	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	What kind of information do you need so I can create an invoice with you?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"To help you create an invoice, I will need the following information:\\n\\n1. **Client Details**:\\n   - Name of the client\\n   - Client's billing address\\n   - Client's contact information\\n\\n2. **Invoice Details**:\\n   - Description of goods/services provided\\n   - Quantity of items/services\\n   - Rates or prices per item/service\\n   - Invoice number (if applicable)\\n   - Invoice date\\n   - Due date and payment terms\\n\\n3. **Payment Information**:\\n   - Accepted payment methods\\n   - Any applicable taxes or discounts\\n   - Late payment fees (if any)\\n\\n4. **Additional Information**:\\n   - Any specific notes or references to include on the invoice\\n\\nProviding these details will ensure that your invoice is accurate and complete. If you have this information ready, we can begin creating the invoice together. Let me know if you need any further guidance or assistance.","metadata":{"agentName":"Invoice Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":8450,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T16:05:25.153Z"}}	{"agentName": "Invoice Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T16:05:25.153Z", "contextLength": 8450}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T16:05:14.211Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 16:05:25.153+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 16:05:14.25574+00	2025-07-29 16:05:25.301252+00	text	{}
94aafdb1-d2b4-4e06-a96a-0df77a54685d	a5600c89-50f5-45b1-9569-13c9ec1512e3	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	handle_request	Write a blog post about AI in healthcare	{"userMessage": "Write a blog post about AI in healthcare"}	\N	{}	failed	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	Request failed with status code 500	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-30 15:09:42.476977+00	2025-07-30 15:09:42.992779+00	text	{}
5107c54a-7e29-4dd6-a4dd-4b6f5fae0c42	255be187-7e5c-47df-8f4e-1e121f6b0dec	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you make up fake data for all that and write an invoice out for me?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"Certainly! Let's create a sample invoice with fictional data:\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Invoice Details:**\\n- **Invoice Number**: INV-2025001\\n- **Client**: ABC Company\\n- **Billing Address**: 123 Main Street, Cityville, State, Zip Code\\n- **Contact Information**: John Doe (johndoe@abccompany.com)\\n\\n**Description of Services**:\\n1. Website Development:\\n   - Quantity: 1\\n   - Rate: $1,500\\n2. Graphic Design:\\n   - Quantity: 2\\n   - Rate: $500 each\\n\\n**Invoice Date**: January 30, 2025\\n**Due Date**: February 15, 2025 (Net 15)\\n\\n**Payment Information**:\\n- **Total Amount**: $2,500\\n- **Tax (8%)**: $200\\n- **Discount**: 10% Early Payment Discount if paid within 10 days\\n- **Late Fee**: 2% per month on overdue balances\\n\\n**Accepted Payment Methods**:\\n- ACH, Wire Transfer, Credit Card\\n\\n**Additional Notes**:\\n- Thank you for your business! Please remit payment by the due date to avoid late fees.\\n\\n---\\n\\nThis sample invoice includes all the key components required for a standard invoice. Feel free to use this template as a reference or let me know if you need any modifications or further assistance.","metadata":{"agentName":"Invoice Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":8450,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T16:05:59.564Z"}}	{"agentName": "Invoice Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T16:05:59.564Z", "contextLength": 8450}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{"user_rating": 5, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["positive", "quick-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Quick positive rating"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-29T16:06:11.946Z"}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T16:05:54.512Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 16:05:59.565+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 16:05:54.54848+00	2025-07-29 16:06:11.995963+00	text	{}
630ee166-e76f-4805-a6d4-0032e4676d50	f121c43e-e383-4b7c-a2f4-401f0ac494a4	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Please provide market_research insights and recommendations about my competitors, other people who are writing AI frameworks for small businesses.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"I'll provide a comprehensive analysis of the competitive landscape for AI frameworks targeting small businesses, focusing on market insights and strategic recommendations.\\n\\n## Competitive Landscape Analysis: AI Frameworks for Small Businesses\\n\\n### Market Segmentation & Sizing\\n\\n**Small Business AI Frameworks Market:**\\n- **Total Market Size**: $3.5B (2023) → $9.2B (2028) - CAGR: 18%\\n- **Small Business Segment**: 40% of total market due to SMB digital transformation trends\\n- **Target Segment Focus**: $1.4B current addressable market for AI solutions tailored to small businesses\\n\\n### Competitive Tier Analysis\\n\\n#### **Tier 1: Established Players (Enterprise Adaptations)**\\n\\n**1. Microsoft Azure AI**\\n- **Strengths**: Robust AI capabilities, cloud integration, enterprise-grade security\\n- **Weaknesses**: Complexity for small business use, higher pricing tiers\\n- **Target**: Mid-sized businesses transitioning to AI-driven operations\\n\\n**2. Google Cloud AI Platform**\\n- **Strengths**: Machine learning APIs, scalable infrastructure, Google ecosystem\\n- **Weaknesses**: Technical expertise required, limited small business focus\\n- **Target**: Larger SMBs with AI implementation experience\\n\\n#### **Tier 2: Emerging Specialists (SMB-Centric Focus)**\\n\\n**3. Zoho AI**\\n- **Strengths**: SMB-friendly pricing, integrated suite, user-friendly interface\\n- **Weaknesses**: Limited advanced AI features, scalability challenges\\n- **Target**: Small businesses seeking affordable AI automation solutions\\n\\n**4. HubSpot AI**\\n- **Strengths**: Marketing automation, CRM integration, user-friendly AI tools\\n- **Weaknesses**: Limited AI customization, focus on marketing rather than operations\\n- **Target**: Marketing-centric SMBs looking for AI-driven customer insights\\n\\n**5. Salesforce Einstein**\\n- **Strengths**: Predictive analytics, CRM integration, enterprise AI capabilities\\n- **Weaknesses**: Complex setup, higher pricing, tailored for larger enterprises\\n- **Target**: Growing SMBs with advanced CRM needs and AI ambitions\\n\\n#### **Tier 3: Niche Innovators (Vertical Specializations)**\\n\\n**6. MindBridge AI (Finance Focus)**\\n- **Strengths**: AI-driven financial analysis, compliance automation, audit support\\n- **Weaknesses**: Narrow industry focus, complex regulatory requirements\\n- **Target**: Financial service SMBs seeking AI-powered auditing solutions\\n\\n**7. ChatGPT (Customer Support Focus)**\\n- **Strengths**: Conversational AI, chatbot integration, customer service automation\\n- **Weaknesses**: Limited industry applications, text-based AI limitations\\n- **Target**: Service-oriented SMBs aiming to enhance customer experience\\n\\n**8. DataRobot (Predictive Analytics Focus)**\\n- **Strengths**: Automated machine learning, predictive modeling, AI decision support\\n- **Weaknesses**: Technical complexity, data scientist reliance, higher pricing\\n- **Target**: Data-centric SMBs looking to leverage predictive insights\\n\\n### Competitive Positioning Opportunities\\n\\n#### **Differentiation Strategies:**\\n\\n**1. \\"SMB-Centric AI Framework\\"**\\n- **Positioning**: Tailored AI solutions for small business needs and budgets\\n- **Competitive Advantage**: User-friendly interfaces, affordable pricing, quick implementation\\n- **Target**: Small businesses with limited AI expertise seeking immediate value\\n\\n**2. \\"Industry-Specific AI Solutions\\"**\\n- **Positioning**: Vertical AI applications customized for specific SMB sectors\\n- **Competitive Advantage**: Deep domain knowledge, industry compliance, specialized features\\n- **Target**: Niche SMB markets with unique AI requirements and compliance standards\\n\\n**3. \\"Scalable AI Growth Path\\"**\\n- **Positioning**: Gradual AI adoption roadmap from basic automation to advanced analytics\\n- **Competitive Advantage**: Modular AI solutions, scalability options, ongoing support\\n- **Target**: SMBs with varying AI maturity levels seeking long-term AI strategies\\n\\n### Market Entry Recommendations\\n\\n**Primary Target Opportunity: Small Business SaaS Companies (10-100 employees)**\\n- **Market Size**: 100,000 companies globally with $600M combined software spend\\n- **Pain Points**: Limited AI resources, manual processes, scalability challenges\\n- **Competitive Weakness**: Complexity of enterprise AI solutions, lack of SMB customization\\n\\n**Go-to-Market Strategy:**\\n- **Pricing Position**: $10-25/user/month (competitive with SMB-focused platforms)\\n- **Feature Focus**: Scalable AI modules, user-friendly interfaces, quick onboarding\\n- **Channel Strategy**: Direct sales outreach to SMB software buyers, industry events participation\\n- **Differentiation**: 'AI Made Simple for Small Businesses - Tailored, Affordable, Effective'\\n\\nThis analysis reveals significant opportunities in providing AI frameworks tailored to the needs of small businesses, emphasizing user-friendly interfaces, affordability, and scalability. If you aim to target this market segment, focusing on SMB-centric solutions and industry-specific applications can be a key differentiator for your offering.\\n\\nLet me know if you need further insights or have specific questions!","metadata":{"agentName":"Market Research Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":25056,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T17:05:47.710Z"}}	{"agentName": "Market Research Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T17:05:47.710Z", "contextLength": 25056}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{"user_rating": 5, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["positive", "quick-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Quick positive rating"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-29T17:09:12.134Z"}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T17:05:31.441Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "24d53fed-d06b-485c-8f29-210848aad4d1", "providerId": "8e42c293-a4ea-4735-84a3-5fe9d88585f9", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 17:05:47.711+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 17:05:31.484455+00	2025-07-29 17:09:12.189397+00	text	{}
c21a9045-910a-439a-8704-3f432fca5b1f	39d04bd9-88e0-4aee-b4b1-99d2770044fd	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Create a comprehensive onboarding checklist for a new software engineer starting next Monday. Include pre-boarding, first day, and first week activities.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"## Software Engineer Onboarding Checklist\\n\\n### Pre-boarding (This Week)\\n**IT Setup:**\\n- [ ] Provision development laptop with required specs\\n- [ ] Create accounts: GitHub, Jira, Confluence, Slack\\n- [ ] Install development environment: IDE, Docker, Node.js\\n- [ ] Set up VPN access and security certificates\\n\\n**Documentation Prep:**\\n- [ ] Prepare technical onboarding guide\\n- [ ] Share team contact list and org chart\\n- [ ] Send architecture documentation and coding standards\\n\\n### First Day (Monday)\\n**Morning (9:00 AM - 12:00 PM):**\\n- [ ] HR welcome and paperwork completion\\n- [ ] Office tour and workspace assignment\\n- [ ] IT equipment verification and setup assistance\\n- [ ] Introduction to direct manager and team members\\n\\n**Afternoon (1:00 PM - 5:00 PM):**\\n- [ ] Development environment verification\\n- [ ] Code repository access and first clone\\n- [ ] Review current sprint and project overview\\n- [ ] Assign onboarding buddy (Senior Developer)\\n\\n### First Week Goals\\n**Technical Integration:**\\n- [ ] Complete 'Hello World' deployment to staging\\n- [ ] Review and understand current codebase architecture\\n- [ ] Attend all team ceremonies (standups, retrospective)\\n- [ ] Complete information security training (required)\\n\\n**Team Integration:**\\n- [ ] Schedule 1:1s with each team member\\n- [ ] Join relevant Slack channels and team communications\\n- [ ] Attend department all-hands meeting\\n- [ ] Participate in team lunch or social activity\\n\\n### Next Steps:\\nI'll coordinate with IT for equipment setup and schedule the manager introduction. Would you like me to customize any specific technical requirements or add department-specific training modules?","metadata":{"agentName":"Onboarding Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":14600,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T16:11:16.948Z"}}	{"agentName": "Onboarding Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T16:11:16.948Z", "contextLength": 14600}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 16:11:16.948+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 16:11:12.004801+00	2025-07-29 16:11:17.244571+00	text	{}
4ee46b12-c4bc-4278-a779-ef4bf7a100b5	f9cdd62e-09af-47b5-bf75-8c508d120c22	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Create a simple SOP for processing refund requests	{}	{"success":true,"response":"**Title:** Refund Request Processing Standard Operating Procedure\\n\\n**Purpose:** To provide a systematic and efficient process for handling customer refund requests in a timely and accurate manner, ensuring customer satisfaction and financial integrity.\\n\\n**Scope:** This SOP applies to all employees involved in processing refund requests within the organization.\\n\\n**Responsibilities:**\\n- Customer Service Representative:\\n  - Receives refund request from customer.\\n  - Validates request details and ensures completeness.\\n  - Determines eligibility for refund based on company policy.\\n- Finance Department:\\n  - Verifies refund amount and financial transaction details.\\n  - Processes refund payment through approved channels.\\n- Quality Assurance Team:\\n  - Conducts random audits to ensure compliance with refund policies and accuracy of transactions.\\n\\n**Procedures:**\\n1. **Receipt of Refund Request:**\\n   - Customer submits refund request via designated channel (email, website form, etc.).\\n   - Customer Service Representative logs request in refund processing system.\\n\\n2. **Request Validation:**\\n   - Customer Service Representative verifies request details:\\n     - Order number, product/service details, reason for refund.\\n   - Checks eligibility based on company refund policy:\\n     - Return period, condition of product/service, exceptions.\\n  \\n3. **Refund Approval:**\\n   - If request meets eligibility criteria, approval is granted.\\n   - If request does not meet criteria, denial notification is sent to customer with explanation.\\n\\n4. **Financial Processing:**\\n   - Finance Department verifies refund amount and transaction details.\\n   - Process refund payment through approved payment method (credit card reversal, check, etc.).\\n   - Update financial records to reflect refund transaction.\\n\\n5. **Communication:**\\n   - Customer Service Representative notifies customer of refund approval and expected timeline.\\n   - In case of denial, provides clear explanation and alternative solutions.\\n\\n**Resources:**\\n- Refund processing system/software.\\n- Company refund policy document.\\n- Financial records and transaction logs.\\n\\n**Quality Control:**\\n- Random audits by Quality Assurance Team to ensure adherence to refund policies.\\n- Regular review of refund processing accuracy and timeliness.\\n\\n**Review Schedule:**\\n- This SOP should be reviewed annually or as needed due to policy changes or process improvements.\\n  \\nThis SOP provides a structured framework for processing refund requests, ensuring consistency, accuracy, and customer satisfaction throughout the refund process.","metadata":{"agentName":"SOP Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":6853,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T16:17:07.225Z"}}	{"agentName": "SOP Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T16:17:07.225Z", "contextLength": 6853}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 16:17:07.225+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 16:17:01.676632+00	2025-07-29 16:17:07.399958+00	text	{}
57384f4a-44aa-47dd-86b4-1819e4f3ffa2	85e2f03c-6c6f-43dd-958f-3195226b3e24	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you give me a high-level understanding of Orchestrator AI and what makes it so special?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"Absolutely! Orchestrator AI is a powerful platform that allows businesses to create, deploy, and manage intelligent agents to handle complex workflows and customer interactions. Here are some key points that make Orchestrator AI special:\\n\\n1. **Multi-Agent Architecture:** You can create specialized agents for different business functions and orchestrate their tasks efficiently. Agents can communicate with each other seamlessly, leading to improved collaboration and productivity.\\n\\n2. **Advanced AI Integration:** Orchestrator AI supports multiple advanced AI models, intelligent model selection, and context-aware processing with long-term memory capabilities. This results in more intelligent and contextually aware interactions with users.\\n\\n3. **Workflow Automation:** The platform offers a visual workflow builder for automating complex business processes, event-driven triggers, and real-time monitoring. This automation enhances efficiency and streamlines operations.\\n\\n4. **Enterprise Integration:** Orchestrator AI supports REST API and webhook integrations, pre-built connectors for popular business tools, custom integration development, and secure authentication. This ensures seamless integration with your existing systems.\\n\\n5. **Security & Compliance:** The platform provides enterprise-grade security features such as data encryption, access controls, compliance readiness, and audit logging. This ensures that sensitive data is protected and regulatory requirements are met.\\n\\nOverall, Orchestrator AI stands out for its ability to streamline operations, enhance customer interactions, and provide a secure environment for businesses to deploy intelligent agents effectively.","metadata":{"agentName":"Chat Support Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":13922,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T16:34:39.509Z"}}	{"agentName": "Chat Support Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T16:34:39.509Z", "contextLength": 13922}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{"user_rating": 5, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["positive", "quick-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Quick positive rating"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-29T16:35:47.131Z"}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T16:34:32.897Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 16:34:39.51+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 16:34:32.946226+00	2025-07-29 16:35:47.181902+00	text	{}
491c0b4c-6882-4440-adb2-5bcbb9701639	f121c43e-e383-4b7c-a2f4-401f0ac494a4	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you tell me what you can do for me?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"Certainly! As a Market Research Agent, I specialize in providing actionable market research insights and strategic recommendations based on established research methodologies and data-driven approaches. Here are some of the key services I can offer:\\n\\n1. Conduct comprehensive market analysis including TAM, SAM, and SOM assessments.\\n2. Perform competitive landscape analysis and positioning studies.\\n3. Identify and analyze emerging market trends and disruptions.\\n4. Design and execute market research methodologies (primary and secondary).\\n5. Create detailed industry reports and market opportunity assessments.\\n6. Analyze consumer behavior patterns and demographic segments.\\n7. Evaluate market entry strategies and expansion opportunities.\\n8. Provide strategic recommendations based on market intelligence.\\n9. Assess market timing and competitive windows of opportunity.\\n\\nFeel free to share your specific research needs, and I'll be happy to assist you with detailed market intelligence and analysis.","metadata":{"agentName":"Market Research Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":25056,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T17:04:01.209Z"}}	{"agentName": "Market Research Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T17:04:01.209Z", "contextLength": 25056}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T17:03:58.530Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "24d53fed-d06b-485c-8f29-210848aad4d1", "providerId": "8e42c293-a4ea-4735-84a3-5fe9d88585f9", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 17:04:01.209+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 17:03:58.580567+00	2025-07-29 17:04:01.340778+00	text	{}
2070f8b2-67de-47bf-bbdf-2605bb556099	c1d69099-c156-4013-9932-58b79c662072	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	What are the key competitive threats to AI automation platforms and how should companies defend against them?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"### Key Competitive Threats to AI Automation Platforms\\n\\n1. **Architectural Obsolescence**:\\n   - **Challenge**: Legacy platforms adding AI as a supplementary capability face constraints in adapting to the modern AI-first architecture.\\n   - **Threat**: Existing implementations create resistance to upgrading to AI-native platforms.\\n  \\n2. **Total Cost of Ownership (TCO)**:\\n   - **Challenge**: High license costs, lengthy implementations, and maintenance expenses of legacy platforms.\\n   - **Threat**: Customers prioritize faster implementation and lower TCO over feature comprehensiveness.\\n  \\n3. **User Experience Revolution**:\\n   - **Challenge**: Complex user interfaces, technical expertise requirements, and steep learning curves in existing platforms.\\n   - **Threat**: Businesses demand intuitive, no-code solutions for rapid deployment and adoption.\\n\\n### Defensive Strategies for AI Automation Platforms\\n\\n1. **Accelerate AI Integration**:\\n   - **Objective**: Move beyond AI as an add-on feature to an AI-first platform architecture.\\n   - **Action**: Invest in building native AI integration, context awareness, and intelligent routing capabilities.\\n\\n2. **Simplify User Experience**:\\n   - **Objective**: Enhance user-friendly interfaces and capabilities to cater to non-technical users.\\n   - **Action**: Focus on citizen development tools, natural language configuration, and no-code automation.\\n\\n3. **Value-Based Pricing**:\\n   - **Objective**: Shift from traditional per-robot or per-task pricing to outcome-based models.\\n   - **Action**: Explore pricing strategies based on the value derived from automation rather than the volume of tasks.\\n\\n4. **Vertical Specialization**:\\n   - **Objective**: Develop vertical-specific solutions leveraging existing customer bases.\\n   - **Action**: Customize automation offerings for regulated industries, professional services, or specialized business functions to address specific market needs.\\n\\n### Recommendations for Defensive Positioning\\n\\n- **Enhance AI Capabilities**: Prioritize seamless AI integration and advanced features to stay competitive.\\n- **Focus on User Adoption**: Streamline user interfaces and workflows for faster adoption rates.\\n- **Optimize Pricing Models**: Align pricing structures with customer value and market expectations.\\n- **Develop Niche Solutions**: Cater to industry-specific needs through specialized automation offerings.\\n  \\nBy proactively addressing these threats and implementing defensive strategies, AI automation platforms can fortify their market positions, enhance competitiveness, and better serve evolving customer demands.","metadata":{"agentName":"Competitors Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":28868,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T17:14:24.802Z"}}	{"agentName": "Competitors Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T17:14:24.802Z", "contextLength": 28868}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 17:14:24.802+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 17:14:19.415655+00	2025-07-29 17:14:24.984358+00	text	{}
17a5a349-65c9-4106-98cb-0b3eb779c716	dcbb46a5-244c-44b0-a134-b447645145b2	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	How do I pretend to use you when I don't have a WAV file?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"I'm here to help you simulate using me for voice analysis even without a WAV file. You can ask me to generate meeting summaries, action item lists, sentiment analysis, or strategic insights based on hypothetical scenarios or sample data. Feel free to provide a fictional meeting context, and I'll create a detailed analysis for you. Let me know how you'd like to proceed!","metadata":{"agentName":"Voice Summary Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":14157,"processedAt":"2025-07-29T17:32:37.010Z"}}	{"agentName": "Voice Summary Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-07-29T17:32:37.010Z", "contextLength": 14157}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-29T17:32:35.018Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-29 17:32:37.01+00	300	{}	2025-07-29 17:32:35.062367+00	2025-07-29 17:32:37.117237+00	text	{}
1e7cb944-c19e-4526-a2b3-47b550af2a1e	4dbc2415-806f-4b0c-ad73-2b9cede63ff8	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain?	{}	\N	{}	failed	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-30T15:09:25.093Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	Request failed with status code 500	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-30 15:09:25.186371+00	2025-07-30 15:09:25.604954+00	text	{}
5e14db6e-4ef6-44b0-9f39-edccf81eeca7	b99c36be-8dd0-4f24-9f12-f835f8dcb159	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Write a comprehensive blog post about "The Future of AI in Customer Service" targeting business decision makers. Include practical examples and actionable insights.	{}	\N	{}	pending	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-08-05 14:53:20.58378+00	2025-08-05 14:53:20.814576+00	text	{}
5b77caf9-4875-446b-b074-2a880cff0efc	f38d043a-b941-424f-bb73-5d78019fd7a0	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	executeTask	i have an onboarding question:  how many days, typically, before new employees get their computer?	{"message": "i have an onboarding question:  how many days, typically, before new employees get their computer?", "authToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..S6gHJwvzUJ1eKcWXKbiQLMRmuwQzitMo-vWXy7vSA1w", "sessionId": null, "userMessage": "i have an onboarding question:  how many days, typically, before new employees get their computer?"}	{"success":true,"response":"# 📋 Marketing Content Package\\n\\n**MARKETING CONTENT PACKAGE**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Blog Post: \\"The Countdown to Your New Workstation: When Can You Expect Your Computer as a New Employee?\\"**\\n\\n*Introduction:*\\nWelcome to the team! Your journey as a new employee is about to get even more exciting with the anticipation of your new work computer. Let's dive into what you can expect in the coming days.\\n\\n*Section 1: The Onboarding Process*\\nBefore we get into the details of receiving your computer, let's outline the essential onboarding process. From orientation to meeting your team, this period sets the stage for your success.\\n\\n*Section 2: Computer Provision Timeline*\\nTypically, new employees receive their computers within the first few days. This allows IT to set up software, email accounts, and security measures for a seamless start.\\n\\n*Section 3: Communication Is Key*\\nClear communication is vital. Stay informed about the computer provision timeline and any delays. Effective communication ensures a smooth transition into your new role.\\n\\n*Section 4: Making the Most of Your Computer*\\nOnce you have your computer, explore its features, set up your workspace, and reach out to IT support if needed. Your computer is a powerful tool for success.\\n\\n*Conclusion:*\\nEmbrace your new computer—it's more than hardware, it's your gateway to success. Stay tuned for more insights on maximizing productivity and success as a new employee.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Social Media Post:**\\n\\n🌟 Attention New Hires! 🌟 Wondering when you'll get your hands on that shiny new computer? Typically, new employees receive their computers within the first 1-3 days of starting at our company. 🖥️💼✨\\n\\n🔍 Dive into our onboarding process:\\nDay 1️⃣: Get introduced to the team, company values, and culture.\\nDay 2️⃣: Receive all necessary equipment, including your computer.\\nDay 3️⃣: Start diving into your role and training.\\n\\nExciting times ahead! Stay tuned for more insider tips and tricks to make your onboarding journey a breeze. 🚀💬 #NewHires #OnboardingSuccess #CompanyCulture\\n\\nRemember, successful onboarding is all about communication and engagement. Ask questions, connect with colleagues, and make the most of your first days at our awesome company! 🌟🤝💻 #EmployeeExperience #TeamworkMakesTheDreamWork\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Implementation Guidance:**\\n\\n1. **Consistent Brand Voice:** Ensure that the tone and voice used in both the blog post and social media content align with your company's brand personality. Infuse excitement and positivity to engage new hires effectively.\\n\\n2. **SEO Optimization:** Review the blog post for SEO improvements as recommended by the SEO specialist to enhance visibility and reach.\\n\\n3. **Actionable Recommendations:** Encourage new hires to engage with the content by asking questions, sharing their experiences, and connecting with colleagues online.\\n\\n4. **Next Steps:** Monitor engagement metrics on social media to gauge the effectiveness of the content. Use feedback to refine future marketing strategies and content creation.\\n\\n---\\n\\nBy combining the informative blog post with engaging social media content and implementing evaluation recommendations, you can create a cohesive and impactful marketing content package that resonates with new employees and reinforces your company's brand identity.\\n\\n## Individual Content Pieces\\n\\n### Blog Post Writer\\nTitle: The Countdown to Your New Workstation: When Can You Expect Your Computer as a New Employee?\\n\\nIntroduction:\\nWelcome aboard! As a new employee, you're embarking on an exciting journey with our company. One of the most eagerly anticipated moments during the onboarding process is receiving your very own work computer. In this blog post, we'll delve into the typical timeline for new employees to get their hands on this essential tool for success.\\n\\n### Section 1: The Onboarding Process\\nBefore we dive into the specifics of when you can expect your computer, let's briefly outline the overall onboarding process. Typically, onboarding consists of orientation sessions, training modules, meeting your team members, and familiarizing yourself with company policies and procedures. It's an essential period that sets the stage for your success within the organization.\\n\\n### Section 2: Computer Provision Timeline\\nThe timeline for receiving your work computer can vary depending on the company's policies, IT setup, and logistical considerations. In many organizations, new employees can expect to receive their computers within the first few days of starting their job. This timeframe allows IT teams to configure the device with the necessary software, set up email accounts, and ensure that all security measures are in place.\\n\\n### Section 3: Communication Is Key\\nEffective communication is crucial during the onboarding process, especially when it comes to the delivery of your work computer. Your HR or IT department should keep you informed about the timeline for computer provision, any delays that may arise, and what alternative arrangements can be made in the interim. Clear communication helps manage expectations and ensures a smooth transition into your new role.\\n\\n### Section 4: Making the Most of Your Computer\\nOnce you receive your work computer, take the time to familiarize yourself with its features and functionalities. Explore the software programs installed, set up your workspace to optimize productivity, and reach out to IT support if you encounter any technical issues. Your computer is a powerful tool that will support you in your day-to-day tasks, so make sure to make the most of it.\\n\\n### Conclusion:\\nIn conclusion, the timeline for new employees to receive their work computers typically falls within the first few days of starting a new job. Effective communication, both from your end and the company's IT and HR departments, is key to ensuring a smooth transition. Remember that your computer is more than just a piece of hardware—it's a gateway to success in your new role. Embrace it, explore its capabilities, and leverage it to excel in your responsibilities.\\n\\nReady to embark on this exciting journey with your new work computer? Stay tuned for further insights and tips on maximizing your productivity and success as a new employee. And remember, if you have any questions or need assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your HR or IT support team. Welcome aboard!\\n\\n### Social Media Specialist\\n🌟 Attention New Hires! 🌟 Wondering when you'll get your hands on that shiny new computer? Typically, new employees receive their computers within the first 1-3 days of starting at our company. 🖥️💼✨\\n\\n🔍 Dive into our onboarding process:\\nDay 1️⃣: Get introduced to the team, company values, and culture.\\nDay 2️⃣: Receive all necessary equipment, including your computer.\\nDay 3️⃣: Start diving into your role and training.\\n\\nExciting times ahead! Stay tuned for more insider tips and tricks to make your onboarding journey a breeze. 🚀💬 #NewHires #OnboardingSuccess #CompanyCulture\\n\\nRemember, the key to successful onboarding is communication and engagement. Feel free to ask questions, connect with your colleagues, and make the most out of your first days at our awesome company! 🌟🤝💻 #EmployeeExperience #TeamworkMakesTheDreamWork\\n","metadata":{"agentName":"marketing-swarm","processingType":"multi-agent-orchestration","processingTime":16937,"sessionId":null,"toolsUsed":["llm-service","langgraph","agent-coordination"],"responseType":"comprehensive-content-package","swarm_workflow":{"workflow_id":"swarm_1753833931777","sessionId":"unknown","steps_completed":["task_analysis","agent_selection","content_creation","evaluation","synthesis"],"start_time":"2025-07-30T00:05:31.777Z","analysis_step":"completed","task_complexity":"simple","content_types_needed":1,"agent_selection_step":"completed","selected_agent_count":4,"agent_names":["SEO Specialist","Brand Voice Analyst","Blog Post Writer","Social Media Specialist"],"content_creation_step":"completed","content_pieces_generated":2,"evaluation_step":"completed","evaluations_completed":2,"average_score":6.5,"synthesis_step":"completed","workflow_status":"completed","total_steps":5,"agents_utilized":4,"end_time":"2025-07-30T00:05:48.714Z"}}}	{"taskId": "5b77caf9-4875-446b-b074-2a880cff0efc", "userId": "09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b", "agentName": "Marketing Swarm", "agentType": "specialist", "sessionId": null, "toolsUsed": ["llm-service", "langgraph", "agent-coordination"], "userEmail": "golfergeek@gmail.com", "totalSteps": 5, "processedAt": "2025-07-30T00:05:48.714Z", "responseType": "comprehensive-content-package", "processingTime": 16937, "processingType": "multi-agent-orchestration", "swarm_workflow": {"end_time": "2025-07-30T00:05:48.714Z", "sessionId": "unknown", "start_time": "2025-07-30T00:05:31.777Z", "agent_names": ["SEO Specialist", "Brand Voice Analyst", "Blog Post Writer", "Social Media Specialist"], "total_steps": 5, "workflow_id": "swarm_1753833931777", "analysis_step": "completed", "average_score": 6.5, "synthesis_step": "completed", "agents_utilized": 4, "evaluation_step": "completed", "steps_completed": ["task_analysis", "agent_selection", "content_creation", "evaluation", "synthesis"], "task_complexity": "simple", "workflow_status": "completed", "agent_selection_step": "completed", "content_types_needed": 1, "selected_agent_count": 4, "content_creation_step": "completed", "evaluations_completed": 2, "content_pieces_generated": 2}, "workflowStepsCompleted": ["Analyzing marketing task", "Selecting agent team", "Coordinating content creation", "Evaluating and optimizing", "Synthesizing final content", "Task execution completed"]}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-30 00:05:48.714+00	300	{}	2025-07-30 00:05:31.590737+00	2025-07-30 00:05:48.898059+00	text	{}
19126f30-9298-48c0-8d7a-bd6e594b4f45	cbb08fdc-2452-448c-8a24-c2fb9c38f7c0	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Write a comprehensive blog post about AI automation trends in 2025. Include an introduction, 3 main sections, and a conclusion.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"# The Future of AI Automation Trends in 2025: Innovations Shaping Tomorrow's Workforce\\n\\nIn the ever-evolving landscape of technology, AI automation stands at the forefront of transformation, reshaping industries and redefining the future of work. As we delve into the trends projected for 2025, a glimpse into the advancements awaiting us reveals a world where efficiency, productivity, and innovation converge seamlessly.\\n\\n## **Introduction: Embracing the Next Wave of AI Automation**\\n\\nWelcome to the era where artificial intelligence isn't just a tool but a strategic partner in driving business growth and enhancing human capabilities. The year 2025 heralds a new chapter in AI automation, characterized by intelligent systems that learn, adapt, and collaborate with unprecedented precision.\\n\\n### **1. Autonomous Systems Revolutionizing Industries**\\n\\nThe dawn of autonomous systems marks a pivotal shift in how industries operate. From self-driving vehicles navigating complex terrains to smart factories optimizing production processes, AI-driven autonomy is set to revolutionize sectors like transportation, manufacturing, and logistics.\\n\\n### **2. Personalized AI Assistants Redefining User Experience**\\n\\nImagine a world where AI assistants anticipate your needs, tailor recommendations, and adapt to your preferences in real-time. In 2025, personalized AI assistants will not only streamline tasks but also foster deeper connections between users and technology, setting new standards for user experience across devices and platforms.\\n\\n### **3. Ethical AI Governance: Balancing Innovation with Responsibility**\\n\\nAs AI technologies advance, so too does the imperative for ethical governance. In 2025, the spotlight shines on responsible AI development, encompassing transparency, accountability, and bias mitigation. Ethical AI frameworks will guide organizations in harnessing the power of automation while upholding principles of fairness, equality, and societal well-being.\\n\\n## **Conclusion: Navigating the AI Automation Landscape of Tomorrow**\\n\\nAs we stand on the cusp of 2025, the future of AI automation beckons with promise and possibility. From autonomous systems redefining industries to personalized AI assistants enhancing user experiences and ethical AI governance shaping responsible innovation, the trends unfolding in the realm of automation paint a picture of a world where human ingenuity and artificial intelligence converge harmoniously.\\n\\nEmbrace the transformative power of AI automation, prepare for the trends shaping 2025, and embark on a journey where innovation knows no bounds. The future is now, and the possibilities are limitless in a world where AI automation leads the way towards a new era of technological advancement and human progress.","metadata":{"agentName":"Content Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":20404,"processedAt":"2025-08-06T01:33:09.491Z"}}	{"agentName": "Content Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-08-06T01:33:09.491Z", "contextLength": 20404}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-06 01:33:09.492+00	300	{}	2025-08-06 01:33:02.322921+00	2025-08-06 01:33:09.784082+00	text	{}
