cb81d216-048a-4eca-b918-0a31dbd88003	f5710ea1-975b-4a4a-b7bf-d732ce487ec9	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	I hit my ball out past the white stakes. What does that mean, and what should I do?	{}	{"response":"If your ball went past the white stakes, it means your ball is out of bounds. This situation comes with a penalty. Here's what you should do:\\n\\n1. Add one penalty stroke to your score.\\n2. Go back to the spot where you last hit the shot.\\n3. Play another ball from that position.\\n\\nMake sure to follow these steps to proceed correctly in the game.","rawApiResponse":{"output":"If your ball went past the white stakes, it means your ball is out of bounds. This situation comes with a penalty. Here's what you should do:\\n\\n1. Add one penalty stroke to your score.\\n2. Go back to the spot where you last hit the shot.\\n3. Play another ball from that position.\\n\\nMake sure to follow these steps to proceed correctly in the game."},"metadata":{"statusCode":200,"attempt":1,"responseTime":1753893493840}}	{"taskId": "cb81d216-048a-4eca-b918-0a31dbd88003", "userId": "09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b", "attempt": 1, "agentName": "Rules Of Golf Agent", "agentType": "engineering", "apiStatus": "executed", "statusCode": 200, "processedAt": "2025-07-30T16:38:13.841Z", "responseTime": 1753893493840}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-30T16:38:04.618Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-30 16:38:13.841+00	300	{}	2025-07-30 16:38:04.724335+00	2025-07-30 16:38:14.094175+00	text	{}
5ecbc8bb-ffa0-46af-83b6-222b37e903bc	0f84d803-1c4f-45ef-8099-46fb8b56ddf2	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you write a blog post about playing golf in the rain?	{}	\N	{}	failed	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-30T15:35:23.939Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	Request failed with status code 500	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-30 15:35:24.035887+00	2025-07-30 15:35:24.590615+00	text	{}
0463dbf5-540d-4cbd-987f-847b36224dee	52d6b373-7f83-4eac-b9ff-e42b7f168f29	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?	{}	{"response":"# Product Requirements Document (PRD) for User Info Management System\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\nThe User Info Management System is designed to centralize and manage user information to provide agents with pertinent details about users. This system will streamline user interactions, improve customer service, and enhance overall user experience. By implementing this system, we aim to increase agent efficiency and customer satisfaction.\\n\\n## 2. Product Overview\\n### Goals:\\n- Centralize user information for easy access and management.\\n- Improve customer service by providing agents with relevant user details.\\n- Enhance user experience through personalized interactions.\\n\\n### Objectives:\\n- Develop a User Info Management System with features for storing, retrieving, and displaying user information.\\n- Implement access control mechanisms to ensure data security and privacy.\\n- Integrate user info input forms for easy data entry.\\n\\n### Success Metrics:\\n- Increase in agent efficiency by 20%.\\n- Reduction in user complaints related to lack of information by 30%.\\n- 95% user satisfaction rating post-implementation.\\n\\n## 3. User Personas & Use Cases\\n### Target Users:\\n1. Customer Support Agents\\n2. Sales Representatives\\n3. Account Managers\\n\\n### User Needs:\\n- Access to comprehensive user information.\\n- Ability to update and retrieve user data efficiently.\\n- Secure handling of sensitive user details.\\n\\n## 4. Functional Requirements\\n1. User Info Management:\\n   - Create, update, and delete user information.\\n   - Store user details such as contact information, purchase history, and preferences.\\n2. Database for User Info Storage:\\n   - Securely store user data in a centralized database.\\n   - Ensure data integrity and availability.\\n3. APIs for User Info Retrieval:\\n   - Develop APIs for retrieving user information programmatically.\\n   - Implement API documentation for easy integration.\\n4. User Info Input Form:\\n   - Design user-friendly forms for inputting user data.\\n   - Include validation checks for data accuracy.\\n5. User Info Display for Agents:\\n   - Display user information in a structured format for agents.\\n   - Enable quick access to relevant user details.\\n6. Access Control for User Info:\\n   - Implement role-based access control to restrict data access.\\n   - Ensure data privacy and compliance with regulations.\\n\\n## 5. User Stories\\n### User Story 1: As a Customer Support Agent\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**: Access user information by entering user ID.\\n- **Workflow**: \\n  1. Log in to the system.\\n  2. Enter the user ID in the search bar.\\n  3. View user details such as contact information and recent interactions.\\n\\n## 6. Non-Functional Requirements\\n- **Performance**: System should respond to user queries within 2 seconds.\\n- **Security**: Implement encryption for sensitive user data.\\n- **Scalability**: System should accommodate a growing user database without performance degradation.\\n\\n## 7. Technical Considerations\\n- **Technology Stack**: Use a robust database system like MySQL for data storage.\\n- **Security**: Implement OAuth for API authentication.\\n- **Integration**: Ensure compatibility with existing CRM systems.\\n\\n## 8. Implementation Timeline\\n1. Requirements Gathering - 2 weeks\\n2. Design and Development - 6 weeks\\n3. Testing and QA - 3 weeks\\n4. Deployment and Training - 1 week\\n\\n## 9. Success Metrics\\n- Increase in agent efficiency: 20%\\n- Reduction in user complaints: 30%\\n- User satisfaction rating: 95%\\n\\n## 10. Risk Assessment\\n### Potential Challenges:\\n- Data privacy and compliance issues.\\n- Integration complexities with existing systems.\\n- User adoption and training challenges.\\n\\n### Mitigation Strategies:\\n- Conduct regular security audits and compliance checks.\\n- Collaborate with IT teams for seamless integration.\\n- Provide comprehensive training and support to users.\\n\\nBy implementing the User Info Management System as per the outlined requirements, we aim to enhance operational efficiency, improve customer service, and drive overall business success.","analysis":{"intent":"Creating a requirements document for adding user information to the system to provide agents with relevant user details","scope":"medium","clarity":"medium","urgency":"normal","domain":"business","confidence":0.8,"key_indicators":["requirements document","adding user info","system","agents","pertinent information"],"missing_info":["specific user info to be added","integration requirements","security considerations"],"summary":"The user is requesting a requirements document to outline the process of adding user information to the system for agents to access relevant details. The request is of medium scope and clarity, with a normal level of urgency in the business domain."},"metadata":{"document_type":"prd","complexity":"medium","features":["User Info Management","Database for User Info Storage","APIs for User Info Retrieval","User Info Input Form","User Info Display for Agents","Access Control for User Info"],"workflow_step":"completed","generated_at":"2025-07-29T18:51:46.133865","processing_type":"modular-langgraph-workflow","processing_method":"real_llm_calls","agent_type":"requirements_writer","tools_used":["langgraph","real-llm-calls","modular-nodes","state-management"],"workflow_steps_completed":["analyze_request","determine_document_type","extract_features","assess_complexity","generate_document","finalize_response"],"method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"executeTask","prompt":"Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?","taskId":"0463dbf5-540d-4cbd-987f-847b36224dee","currentUser":{"id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-07-29T23:51:18.013Z","createdAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.557Z","updatedAt":"2025-07-29T23:51:18.017Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"bd517515-cb47-40de-ae10-5ac590c1c29e","id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","user_id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","identity_data":{"email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566752Z","created_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com"}]},"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..16txhSnGVwpxOxIihudMFgxXpxVRlBaNkbctQTaqjXQ","conversationHistory":[]},"agentName":"Requirements Writer","timestamp":"2025-07-29T23:51:29.387Z","taskId":"0463dbf5-540d-4cbd-987f-847b36224dee","llmPreferences":{},"completion_timestamp":"2025-07-29T18:51:46.133106","workflow_status":"success","total_workflow_steps":9,"content_length":3986,"features_identified":6,"document_sections":19}}	{"method": "processTask", "taskId": "0463dbf5-540d-4cbd-987f-847b36224dee", "features": ["User Info Management", "Database for User Info Storage", "APIs for User Info Retrieval", "User Info Input Form", "User Info Display for Agents", "Access Control for User Info"], "agentName": "Requirements Writer", "timestamp": "2025-07-29T23:51:29.387Z", "agent_type": "requirements_writer", "complexity": "medium", "tools_used": ["langgraph", "real-llm-calls", "modular-nodes", "state-management"], "g