34f05c30-c444-4926-a6fe-21efa15d8b45	52d6b373-7f83-4eac-b9ff-e42b7f168f29	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?	{"message": "Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?", "authToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..kVhb7uLqPObX0Hsalkg8dn9DDidOUlXthcrZpW_CleA", "sessionId": null, "userMessage": "Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?"}	{"response":"# Product Requirements Document (PRD) - Adding User Info to the System\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\nThis PRD outlines the requirements for adding user information to our system to ensure that all agents have access to pertinent user details. By enhancing the system with this functionality, we aim to improve customer service efficiency and effectiveness.\\n\\n## 2. Product Overview\\n### Goals:\\n- Enhance customer service by providing agents with comprehensive user information.\\n- Improve user experience by personalizing interactions based on user data.\\n### Objectives:\\n- Streamline the process of accessing and updating user information.\\n- Ensure data security and privacy.\\n### Success Metrics:\\n- Increase in customer satisfaction scores.\\n- Reduction in average handling time per customer request.\\n\\n## 3. User Personas & Use Cases\\n### Target Users:\\n- Customer service agents\\n- System administrators\\n### User Needs:\\n- Access to user profiles including contact information, purchase history, and preferences.\\n- Ability to update user information securely.\\n\\n## 4. Functional Requirements\\n1. **Authentication**:\\n   - Secure login for agents and administrators.\\n2. **Database**:\\n   - Storage of user information in a centralized database.\\n3. **Integration**:\\n   - Integration with existing CRM systems or databases for data synchronization.\\n4. **UI/Interface**:\\n   - User-friendly interface for agents to view and update user details.\\n5. **Security**:\\n   - Role-based access control to ensure data confidentiality.\\n\\n## 5. User Stories\\n1. **As a customer service agent, I want to log in securely to access user information.**\\n   - Acceptance Criteria: Agents can log in using unique credentials.\\n   - Workflow: Agent enters username and password to access the system.\\n2. **As an agent, I want to view a user's contact details quickly.**\\n   - Acceptance Criteria: Agents can access user contact information in one click.\\n   - Workflow: Agent searches for a user and clicks to view contact details.\\n\\n## 6. Non-Functional Requirements\\n- **Performance**: System should load user information within 2 seconds.\\n- **Security**: Data encryption at rest and in transit.\\n- **Scalability**: System should handle a growing user base without performance degradation.\\n\\n## 7. Technical Considerations\\n- **Authentication**: Implement OAuth for secure login.\\n- **Database**: Use a relational database for structured data storage.\\n- **Integration**: APIs for seamless integration with CRM systems.\\n- **UI/Interface**: Develop responsive UI for desktop and mobile devices.\\n- **Security**: Implement HTTPS protocol for secure data transfer.\\n\\n## 8. Implementation Timeline\\n1. **Phase 1 - Planning**: Define requirements and finalize design (2 weeks).\\n2. **Phase 2 - Development**: Implement authentication and database structure (4 weeks).\\n3. **Phase 3 - Integration**: Integrate with CRM systems and develop UI (6 weeks).\\n4. **Phase 4 - Testing**: Conduct system testing and security audits (2 weeks).\\n\\n## 9. Success Metrics\\n- **KPIs**:\\n   - Increase in the number of user profiles updated per day.\\n   - Reduction in data access time for agents.\\n- **Measurement Criteria**:\\n   - Weekly reports on user profile updates.\\n   - System performance monitoring for response times.\\n\\n## 10. Risk Assessment\\n### Potential Challenges:\\n- Data security vulnerabilities.\\n- Integration complexities with existing systems.\\n- User adoption and training challenges.\\n### Mitigation Strategies:\\n- Regular security audits and updates.\\n- Collaborate with IT teams for seamless integration.\\n- Provide comprehensive training to agents on the new system.\\n\\nBy following this PRD, we aim to successfully implement the feature of adding user information to our system, enhancing customer service capabilities and user experience.","analysis":{"intent":"Creating a requirements document for adding user info to the system for agent reference","scope":"medium","clarity":"medium","urgency":"normal","domain":"business","confidence":0.8,"key_indicators":["requirements document","adding user info","agents","pertinent information"],"missing_info":["specific user info needed","level of system integration","format of pertinent information"],"summary":"The user is requesting a requirements document to detail the process of adding user information to the system for agents' reference, aiming to ensure agents have relevant details about users. The request is of medium scope and urgency, involving the business domain. However, further clarification is needed on the specific user information, system integration level, and format of pertinent information."},"metadata":{"document_type":"prd","complexity":"medium","features":["Authentication","Database","Integration","Ui","Interface","Security"],"workflow_step":"completed","generated_at":"2025-07-29T18:56:39.041467","processing_type":"modular-langgraph-workflow","processing_method":"real_llm_calls","agent_type":"requirements_writer","tools_used":["langgraph","real-llm-calls","modular-nodes","state-management"],"workflow_steps_completed":["analyze_request","determine_document_type","extract_features","assess_complexity","generate_document","finalize_response"],"method":"processTask","originalParams":{"message":"Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?","userMessage":"Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?","sessionId":null,"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..kVhb7uLqPObX0Hsalkg8dn9DDidOUlXthcrZpW_CleA","method":"executeTask","prompt":"Can you write me a requirements document about adding user info to our system so that all our agents have pertinent information about the user?","taskId":"34f05c30-c444-4926-a6fe-21efa15d8b45","currentUser":{"id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-07-29T23:56:04.509Z","createdAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.557Z","updatedAt":"2025-07-29T23:56:04.512Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"bd517515-cb47-40de-ae10-5ac590c1c29e","id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","user_id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","identity_data":{"email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566752Z","created_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com"}]},"conversationHistory":[]},"agentName":"Requirements Writer","timestamp":"2025-07-29T23:56:21.303Z","taskId":"34f05c30-c444-4926-a6fe-21efa15d8b45","llmPreferences":{},"completion_timestamp":"2025-07-29T18:56:39.040776","workflow_status":"success","total_w