"LangChain.js","Supabase Tools Utilities","PostgreSQL","Natural Language to SQL"],"responseType":"metrics_analysis","sqlGenerated":"SELECT \\"name\\", SUM(kd.value) AS total_revenue\\nFROM companies c\\nJOIN departments d ON c.id = d.company_id\\nJOIN kpi_data kd ON d.id = kd.department_id\\nJOIN kpi_metrics km ON kd.metric_id = km.id\\nWHERE km.name = 'Revenue'\\nAND kd.date_recorded >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '1 year'\\nGROUP BY c.id\\nORDER BY total_revenue DESC\\nLIMIT 5;","executionTime":1415,"rowCount":0,"langchainEnabled":true}},{"role":"user","content":"Show me the top 5 companies by revenue in the last year","timestamp":"2025-08-06T13:59:47.056Z"},{"role":"assistant","content":"## Generated SQL Query\\n```sql\\nSELECT c.name AS company_name, SUM(kd.value) AS total_revenue\\nFROM companies c\\nJOIN departments d ON c.id = d.company_id\\nJOIN kpi_data kd ON d.id = kd.department_id\\nWHERE kd.date_recorded >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '1 year'\\nGROUP BY c.name\\nORDER BY total_revenue DESC\\nLIMIT 5;\\n```\\n\\n## Query Results\\nFound 5 results:\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\"company_name\\": \\"RetailMax Solutions\\",\\n    \\"total_revenue\\": 310203243.31\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\"company_name\\": \\"RetailMax LLC\\",\\n    \\"total_revenue\\": 305999241.72\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\"company_name\\": \\"TechCorp Inc\\",\\n    \\"total_revenue\\": 300234108.62\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\"company_name\\": \\"ServicePro Co\\",\\n    \\"total_revenue\\": 294250638.81\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\"company_name\\": \\"HealthTech Medical\\",\\n    \\"total_revenue\\": 293979190.55\\n  }\\n]\\n\\n## Analysis\\nThe top 5 companies by revenue in the last year are as follows:\\n1. RetailMax Solutions: $310,203,243.31\\n2. RetailMax LLC: $305,999,241.72\\n3. TechCorp Inc: $300,234,108.62\\n4. ServicePro Co: $294,250,638.81\\n5. HealthTech Medical: $293,979,190.55\\n\\nThese companies have shown significant revenue generation over the past year, with RetailMax Solutions leading the pack. It would be beneficial to further analyze the factors contributing to the success of these top-performing companies and identify potential strategies that can be adopted by other companies to enhance their revenue streams.","timestamp":"2025-08-06T14:00:01.591Z","taskId":"3b6be531-a70f-46d4-95f4-bdb81ecae52a","metadata":{"isPlaceholder":false,"isCompleted":true,"completedAt":"2025-08-06T14:00:01.591Z","agentType":"finance","functionStatus":"executed","processedAt":"2025-08-06T14:00:01.471Z","method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"process","prompt":"Show me the top 5 companies by revenue in the last year","taskId":"3b6be531-a70f-46d4-95f4-bdb81ecae52a","currentUser":{"id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","email":"golfergeek@gmail.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.491Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.491Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-08-05T16:10:23.405Z","createdAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.474Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-06T13:57:49.753Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"7c4d7009-91f8-4e8b-b28d-7f8b52a17a0b","id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","user_id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","identity_data":{"email":"golfergeek@gmail.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.48662Z","created_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.486679Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.486679Z","email":"golfergeek@gmail.com"}]},"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..UWPOasbGbyqwzjJ_UOuvPpuQYueOfEdjFzEJ1JGl0cM","llmSelection":{"providerId":"7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f","modelId":"494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4","cidafmOptions":{"activeStateModifiers":[],"responseModifiers":[],"executedCommands":[],"customOptions":{"customModifiers":[]}},"temperature":0.7},"conversationHi