a0360efb-1a4d-41ae-adbc-b71a124cb9d2	098389a4-5325-4411-a61f-477d2f93d480	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Hello, can you help me with onboarding information?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"Certainly! Onboarding is a crucial process for new employees to familiarize themselves with the company, its culture, policies, and procedures. It's designed to help you integrate smoothly into your new role and environment.\\n\\nThe onboarding process typically includes filling out necessary paperwork, receiving an employee handbook, meeting key team members, and undergoing training. This process is essential to ensure that you have the information and resources needed to be successful in your new position.\\n\\nTo start the onboarding process, please reach out to your direct manager or the HR department. They will provide you with the necessary forms and information to get started. Make sure to complete all required paperwork accurately and in a timely manner to avoid any delays in your onboarding process.\\n\\nDuring onboarding, you can expect to learn about company policies, benefits, work expectations, and have the opportunity to ask questions. You may also receive training on specific job-related tasks and systems.\\n\\nIf you have any questions or need additional support during the onboarding process, please don't hesitate to reach out to your HR representative or designated onboarding contact. They are there to assist you and ensure a smooth transition into your new role. \\n\\nRemember, the onboarding process is designed to support you as you acclimate to your new workplace, so feel free to ask questions and seek clarification on anything you may not understand. Welcome aboard, and best of luck with your onboarding journey!","metadata":{"agentType":"specialist","functionStatus":"executed","processedAt":"2025-08-06T01:36:26.138Z","method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"executeTask","prompt":"Hello, can you help me with onboarding information?","