ssification", "response_generation"], "workflow_status": "completed", "complexity_level": "simple", "classification_step": "completed"}, "agentName": "HR Assistant", "agentType": "specialist", "toolsUsed": ["llm-service", "langgraph"], "userEmail": "testuser@golfergeek.com", "totalSteps": 2, "processedAt": "2025-08-06T01:36:25.987Z", "responseType": "hr-assistance", "processingTime": 3295, "processingType": "langgraph-workflow", "workflowStepsCompleted": ["Classifying HR query", "Generating HR response", "Task execution completed"]}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-06 01:36:25.987+00	300	{}	2025-08-06 01:36:22.479472+00	2025-08-06 01:36:26.197238+00	text	{}
4d2f95ff-5586-433a-9dfe-f82a8634987e	4dbc2415-806f-4b0c-ad73-2b9cede63ff8	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Can you write a short blog post about playing golf in the rain?	{}	\N	{}	failed	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-30T14:57:59.788Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	Hiverarchy authentication failed: No access token received from Hiverarchy	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-30 14:57:59.860947+00	2025-07-30 14:58:00.529935+00	text	{}
7eb14131-4c6c-46c6-a9af-d78bcb98c38f	47ee8d3d-f85b-4a2f-ace2-ffdb12081018	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	Write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"# 📋 Marketing Content Package\\n\\n**MARKETING CONTENT PACKAGE**\\n\\n**Blog Post: Embracing the Elements: The Joys of Playing Golf in the Rain**\\n\\n**Introduction:**\\nRainy days on the golf course can offer a unique and rewarding experience for those willing to embrace the elements. Explore the beauty and challenges of playing golf in the rain and discover tips to make the most of your wet weather round.\\n\\n**Body:**\\n- **The Beauty of Rainy Golf Days:** Experience the serene atmosphere and less crowded courses that rainy days bring.\\n- **Challenges and Opportunities:** Learn how to navigate wet conditions and improve your adaptability as a golfer.\\n- **Tips for Playing Golf in the Rain:** Dress appropriately, protect your equipment, adjust your game, and stay positive for a successful round.\\n\\n**Conclusion:**\\nDon't let a little rain dampen your spirits – embrace the challenge, adapt your game, and become a more resilient golfer. Share your rainy day golfing experiences and tips in the comments below.\\n\\n**Call to Action:**\\nShare your rainy day golfing experiences and tips in the comments below. Let's build a community of golf enthusiasts who embrace the challenge of wet weather golf!\\n\\n**Social Media Post: Embrace the Rain: Tips for Playing Golf in Wet Weather**\\n\\n**Introduction:**\\nDiscover tips and tricks for making the most of a rainy day on the golf course and join a community of golf enthusiasts who embrace the challenge of wet weather golf.\\n\\n**Body:**\\n- **Embrace the Elements:** Shift your mindset and view playing golf in the rain as an opportunity to test your skills in different conditions.\\n- **Gear Up:** Invest in proper rain gear and adjust your game for a comfortable and enjoyable round.\\n- **Adjust Your Game:** Make necessary adjustments to your grip, club selection, and aim for a successful wet weather round.\\n- **Stay Positive:** Maintain a positive attitude to enhance your performance and enjoy the unique experience of playing golf in the rain.\\n\\n**Conclusion:**\\nMake the most of a wet weather round by embracing the elements, gearing up with the right equipment, and maintaining a positive attitude. Share your own tips and experiences in the comments below.\\n\\n**Call to Action:**\\nShare your tips and experiences of playing golf in the rain in the comments below. Let's build a community of golf enthusiasts who aren't afraid to take on the challenge of wet weather golf! #RainyDayGolf #GolfingInStyle\\n\\n**Implementation Guidance:**\\n- Ensure consistent brand voice by incorporating brand-specific language and tone throughout the content.\\n- Align the Call to Action with the brand's values and objectives for a stronger connection with the audience.\\n- Engage with your audience by responding to comments, asking questions, and encouraging them to share their own rainy day golf stories to increase engagement and build a loyal following of golf enthusiasts on social media.\\n\\n**Actionable Recommendations:**\\n- Share the blog post on your website and social media channels to reach a wider audience.\\n- Encourage user-generated content by asking followers to share their rainy day golf experiences and tips.\\n- Monitor engagement metrics and adjust your content strategy based on audience feedback for continuous improvement.\\n\\n**Next Steps:**\\n- Implement the optimized marketing content package across your digital platforms.\\n- Track performance metrics to measure the impact of the campaign.\\n- Continuously engage with your audience to foster a community of dedicated golf enthusiasts who embrace the challenge of playing golf in various weather conditions.\\n\\n## Individual Content Pieces\\n\\n### Blog Post Writer\\n**Blog Post Title: Embracing the Elements: The Joys of Playing Golf in the Rain**\\n\\n**Introduction:**\\nRainy days on the golf course can be a mixed bag of challenges and opportunities. While many golfers prefer clear skies and sunshine, playing in the rain can offer a unique and rewarding experience for those willing to embrace the elements. In this blog post, we will explore the joys of playing golf in the rain and share some tips to help you make the most of your wet weather round.\\n\\n**The Beauty of Rainy Golf Days:**\\nPlaying golf in the rain can be a refreshing change of pace from the typical sunny days on the course. The sound of raindrops on your umbrella, the glistening of rain-soaked fairways, and the smell of fresh rain in the air can create a serene and peaceful atmosphere that enhances the overall golfing experience. Rainy days also tend to keep the course less crowded, allowing for a more leisurely round and the opportunity to appreciate the beauty of nature in a different light.\\n\\n**Challenges and Opportunities:**\\nOf course, playing golf in the rain comes with its fair share of challenges. Wet conditions can make the course play longer, affect ball flight, and require adjustments to your grip and swing. However, these challenges also present opportunities to improve your skills and adaptability as a golfer. Learning to navigate wet fairways, manage your equipment in the rain, and adjust your strategy can help you become a more well-rounded player capable of handling a variety of conditions.\\n\\n**Tips for Playing Golf in the Rain:**\\n1. **Dress Appropriately:** Invest in quality rain gear, including a waterproof jacket, pants, and gloves, to stay dry and comfortable throughout your round.\\n2. **Protect Your Equipment:** Use a waterproof golf bag cover or umbrella to keep your clubs dry and prevent damage to your equipment.\\n3. **Adjust Your Game:** Be prepared to play for more carry and less roll on wet fairways, and consider using a lower ball flight to minimize the impact of rain on your shots.\\n4. **Stay Positive:** Embrace the challenge of playing in the rain, stay focused on your game, and maintain a positive attitude to make the most of your wet weather round.\\n\\n**Conclusion:**\\nWhile playing golf in the rain may not be everyone's cup of tea, it can offer a unique and memorable experience for those willing to venture out onto the course in less-than-ideal conditions. By embracing the elements, adapting your game, and staying positive, you can discover the joys of rainy golf days and become a more resilient and versatile golfer in the process. So, next time the forecast calls for showers, don't let a little rain dampen your spirits – grab your rain gear, hit the links, and enjoy the beauty of golf in the rain.\\n\\n**Call to Action:**\\nAre you ready to take on the challenge of playing golf in the rain? Share your rainy day golfing experiences in the comments below and let us know your top tips for mastering wet weather rounds. And remember, when it rains, it pours... but that doesn't mean you can't have a great round of golf!\\n\\n### Social Media Specialist\\nTitle: Embrace the Rain: Tips for Playing Golf in Wet Weather\\n\\nIntroduction:\\nGolf is a sport that thrives on beautiful, sunny days with clear skies and gentle breezes. However, every dedicated golfer knows that sometimes the weather doesn't cooperate. Playing golf in the rain can be a unique experience that challenges your skills and adds a new dimension to the game. In this post, we'll explore some tips and tricks for making the most of a rainy day on the golf course.\\n\\nBody:\\n\\n1. Embrace the Elements:\\nPlaying golf in the rain requires a shift in mindset. Instead of seeing it as an inconvenience, embrace the challenge and view it as an opportunity to test your skills in different conditions. Remember, golf is an outdoor sport, and weather variability is part of the game's charm.\\n\\n2. Gear Up:\\nInvest in proper rain gear to stay dry and comfortable on the course. A good waterproof jacket, pants, and a sturdy umbrella can make a world of difference in your playing experience. Additionally, consider wearing a hat with a brim to keep rain out of your face and improve visibility.\\n\\n3. Adjust Your Game:\\nPlaying in the rain requires some adjustments to your usual approach. The wet conditions can affect your grip, so consider using a glove specifically designed for rainy weather. Additionally, the ball may not travel as far on soggy fairways, so be prepared to adjust your club selection and aim accordingly.\\n\\n4. Stay Positive:\\nMaintaining a positive attitude is key to enjoying a rainy round of golf. Focus on the challenge at hand, appreciate the beauty of a rain-drenched course, and have fun with your fellow players. Remember, a positive mindset can contribute to better performance on the course.\\n\\nConclusion:\\nPlaying golf in the rain can be a rewarding experience that tests your skills and resilience. By embracing the elements, gearing up with the right equipment, adjusting your game, and maintaining a positive attitude, you can make the most of a wet weather round. So next time the forecast calls for rain, don't let it deter you from hitting the links – grab your rain gear and enjoy a unique golfing experience!\\n\\nCall to Action:\\nShare your own tips and experiences of playing golf in the rain in the comments below. Let's build a community of golf enthusiasts who aren't afraid to take on the challenge of wet weather golf! #RainyDayGolf #GolfingInStyle\\n\\nRemember to engage with your audience by responding to comments, asking questions, and encouraging them to share their own rainy day golf stories. Sharing user-generated content and creating a sense of community around a common interest like playing golf in different weather conditions can help increase engagement and build a loyal following of golf enthusiasts on social media.\\n","metadata":{"agentType":"specialist","functionStatus":"executed","processedAt":"2025-08-05T19:38:05.991Z","method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"process","prompt":"Write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain.","taskId":"7eb14131-4c6c-46c6-a9af-d78bcb98c38f","currentUser":{"id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","email":"golfergeek@gmail.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.491Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.491Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-08-05T16:10:23.405Z","createdAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.474Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-05T18:56:33.394Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"7c4d7009-91f8-4e8b-b28d-7f8b52a17a0b","id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","user_id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","identity_data":{"email":"golfergeek@gmail.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.48662Z","created_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.486679Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.486679Z","email":"golfergeek@gmail.com"}]},"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..H2hrOWGYac3Kqm8i5n2880jCtQLK-rBBl7XcTGJGHdU","llmSelection":{"providerId":"7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f","modelId":"494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4","cidafmOptions":{"activeStateModifiers":[],"responseModifiers":[],"executedCommands":[],"customOptions":{"customModifiers":[]}},"temperature":0.7},"conversationHistory":[{"role":"assistant","content":"Hello! I'm the Content. How can I help you today?","timestamp":"2025-08-05T19:37:27.111Z","metadata":{"isWelcome":true}},{"role":"user","content":"Write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain.","timestamp":"2025-08-05T19:37:34.460Z"}]},"agentName":"marketing-swarm","timestamp":"2025-08-05T19:37:34.961Z","taskId":"7eb14131-4c6c-46c6-a9af-d78bcb98c38f","processingType":"multi-agent-orchestration","processingTime