aiting for execution...	{"user_rating": 5, "evaluation_details": {"tags": ["positive", "quick-rating", "task-evaluation"], "userContext": "Quick positive rating"}, "evaluation_timestamp": "2025-07-30T16:37:28.215Z"}	{"createdAt": "2025-07-30T16:35:20.339Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "24d53fed-d06b-485c-8f29-210848aad4d1", "providerId": "8e42c293-a4ea-4735-84a3-5fe9d88585f9", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-07-30 16:35:42.875+00	300	{}	2025-07-30 16:35:20.442815+00	2025-07-30 16:37:28.328293+00	text	{}
3c802893-e651-4dd5-896e-c9286b1cd490	cbed3b00-cbdc-4ffa-b70f-d9a661d4af8b	e2ee07ca-397d-40fa-9196-74cbf02c65ad	process	Can you write me a blog post about how cool and awesome I am?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"I'm here to help you create engaging and informative content, but unfortunately, writing a blog post about an individual's awesomeness isn't within the scope of the content I can provide. If you have any other topic in mind related to technology, business, lifestyle, finance, education, or any other area, feel free to let me know, and I'll be happy to assist you in creating a high-quality blog post on that subject.","metadata":{"agentName":"Blog Post Writer","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":6321,"processedAt":"2025-08-01T15:08:00.775Z"}}	{"agentName": "Blog Post Writer", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-08-01T15:08:00.775Z", "contextLength": 6321}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-08-01T15:07:57.311Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-01 15:08:00.776+00	300	{}	2025-08-01 15:07:57.445355+00	2025-08-01 15:08:00.999906+00	text	{}
77db092c-5ac3-4fe4-b095-7f27f7643c6c	098389a4-5325-4411-a61f-477d2f93d480	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Hello, can you help me with onboarding information?	{}	{"success":true,"response":"Certainly! Onboarding is a crucial process that helps new employees familiarize themselves with the organization, its policies, procedures, and culture. Here's some information to guide you through the onboarding process:\\n\\n1. **Relevant Policy:** Our onboarding process is designed to provide you with essential information about the company, your role, benefits, and workplace expectations. It includes completing necessary paperwork, training sessions, and introductions to key team members.\\n\\n2. **Purpose:** This policy exists to ensure that new employees have a smooth transition into the company, understand their roles and responsibilities, and feel supported as they begin their journey with us. Effective onboarding leads to higher employee engagement, faster integration into the team, and improved retention rates.\\n\\n3. **Specific Steps:** To start the onboarding process, you will receive an email or a welcome package with instructions on how to complete necessary paperwork, such as tax forms and company policies acknowledgment. You will also be scheduled for orientation sessions to learn about our company culture, mission, values, and job-specific training.\\n\\n4. **Expectations:** During onboarding, you can expect to learn about our company's history, organizational structure, benefits package, IT setup, and other important information to help you succeed in your role. This process may vary depending on your position, but the goal is to ensure you have all the resources and support needed to thrive in your new role.\\n\\n5. **Support:** If you have any questions or need assistance during the onboarding process, please reach out to your HR contact or your manager for guidance. They will be able to provide you with the necessary support and clarification on any aspect of the onboarding process.\\n\\nRemember, onboarding is an exciting time to learn about our company and start building relationships within the organization. We are here to support you every step of the way. Welcome aboard, and best of luck with your onboarding journey!","metadata":{"agentType":"specialist","functionStatus":"executed","processedAt":"2025-08-06T10:39:21.278Z","method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"executeTask","prompt":"Hello, can you help me with onboarding information?","taskId":"77db092c-5ac3-4fe4-b095-7f27f7643c6c","currentUser":{"id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-08-06T10:39:13.045Z","createdAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.557Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-06T10:39:13.048Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"bd517515-cb47-40de-ae10-5ac590c1c29e","id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","user_id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","identity_data":{"email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566752Z","created_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com"}]},"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..uZw8nForCrPvFKHbz0i00_jpF5jwbg0Q-xQdiaNcH_w","conversationHistory":[]},"agentName":"hr-assistant","timestamp":"2025-08-06T10:39:13.752Z","taskId":"77db092c-5ac3-4fe4-b095-7f27f7643c6c","processingType":"langgraph-workflow","processingTime":7344,"toolsUsed":["llm-service","langgraph"],"responseType":"hr-assistance","workflow":{"workflow_id":"hr_1754476753753","sessionId":"unknown","steps_completed":["classification","response_generation"],"classification_step":"completed","query_type":"policy","response_step":"completed","complexity_level":"simple","sensitive_topic":false,"workflow_status":"completed","total_steps":2}}}	{"taskId": "77db092c-5ac3-4fe4-b095-7f27f7643c6c", "userId": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "workflow": {"sessionId": "unknown", "query_type": "policy", "total_steps": 2, "workflow_id": "hr_1754476753753", "response_step": "completed", "sensitive_topic": false, "steps_completed": ["classification", "response_generation"], "workflow_status": "completed", "complexity_level": "simple", "classification_step": "completed"}, "agentName": "HR Assistant", "agentType": "specialist", "toolsUsed": ["llm-service", "langgraph"], "userEmail": "testuser@golfergeek.com", "totalSteps": 2, "processedAt": "2025-08-06T10:39:21.098Z", "responseType": "hr-assistance", "processingTime": 7344, "processingType": "langgraph-workflow", "workflowStepsCompleted": ["Classifying HR query", "Generating HR response", "Task execution completed"]}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-06 10:39:21.098+00	300	{}	2025-08-06 10:39:13.527114+00	2025-08-06 10:39:21.387593+00	text	{}
1808054d-804f-4727-a977-a8817c662a88	cbed3b00-cbdc-4ffa-b70f-d9a661d4af8b	e2ee07ca-397d-40fa-9196-74cbf02c65ad	process	How cool and awesome the service we're providing is.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"I can certainly help you create a blog post highlighting the cool and awesome services your company provides. Let's dive into crafting that content!\\n\\n# The Cool and Awesome Services Revolutionizing [Your Industry] in [Year]\\n\\nIn a fast-paced world where innovation is key, [Your Company Name] is at the forefront of delivering unparalleled services that are not just cool and awesome but also transformative for [industry/sector]. With a commitment to excellence and a passion for [industry-specific value proposition], we are redefining standards and setting new benchmarks for success.\\n\\n## Elevating [Industry] Standards with Cutting-Edge Solutions\\n\\n### Embracing Innovation for Unmatched Service Excellence\\n[Highlight key aspects of your services that set you apart from competitors and resonate with your target audience]\\n\\n## Experience the Difference with [Your Company Name]\\n\\n### Seamless Integration and Customization for Every Client\\n[Provide examples or case studies showcasing how your services have positively impacted clients in your industry]\\n\\n## Content Metadata\\n- **Word Count**: [Customize based on your preference]\\n- **Reading Time**: [Customize based on your word count]\\n- **Target Audience**: [Specify your target audience - e.g., industry professionals, businesses, consumers]\\n- **Content Type**: [Highlight the type of content - e.g., promotional, informational, case study]\\n\\n## SEO Elements\\n- **Meta Description**: \\"Discover how [Your Company Name] is revolutionizing [industry/sector] with its innovative and exceptional services that are setting new standards in [year].\\"\\n- **Primary Keywords**: [List main keywords related to your services]\\n- **Secondary Keywords**: [Include supporting keywords for SEO optimization]\\n- **Tags**: [Add relevant tags related to your industry and services]\\n\\nFeel free to provide specific details or key points about your services, and I'll tailor the content to highlight the unique aspects that make your services cool and awesome.","metadata":{"agentName":"Blog Post Writer","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":6321,"processedAt":"2025-08-01T15:08:27.840Z"}}	{"agentName": "Blog Post Writer", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-08-01T15:08:27.840Z", "contextLength": 6321}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{"createdAt": "2025-08-01T15:08:18.288Z", "originalLLMSelection": {"modelId": "494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4", "providerId": "7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f", "temperature": 0.7, "cidafmOptions": {"customOptions": {"customModifiers": []}, "executedCommands": [], "responseModifiers": [], "activeStateModifiers": []}}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-01 15:08:27.841+00	300	{}	2025-08-01 15:08:18.47959+00	2025-08-01 15:08:28.357103+00	text	{}
a67c4da7-def7-4404-b50e-3ce1ddffbb23	cbb08fdc-2452-448c-8a24-c2fb9c38f7c0	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Write a comprehensive blog post about AI automation trends in 2025. Include an introduction, 3 main sections, and a conclusion.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"# Unveiling the Future: AI Automation Trends in 2025\\n\\nIn the ever-evolving landscape of technology, artificial intelligence (AI) continues to drive remarkable transformations across industries. As we step into 2025, the realm of AI automation is poised for unprecedented growth and innovation, shaping the way businesses operate and interact with their environments. Let's delve into the cutting-edge AI automation trends that are set to revolutionize the way we work and live.\\n\\n## Section 1: AI-Powered Personalization\\n\\nPersonalization has been a key focus for businesses aiming to enhance customer experiences, and in 2025, AI is taking this concept to new heights. Through advanced algorithms and machine learning capabilities, AI systems can analyze vast amounts of data to create hyper-personalized interactions. From tailored product recommendations to customized marketing messages, AI-driven personalization is set to redefine customer engagement strategies across all touchpoints.\\n\\n## Section 2: Autonomous Decision-Making\\n\\nIn the coming year, AI automation will increasingly empower autonomous decision-making processes. With the integration of AI systems capable of processing complex data sets in real-time, businesses can automate critical decisions that once required human intervention. From predictive maintenance in manufacturing to dynamic pricing strategies in e-commerce, autonomous decision-making driven by AI algorithms will optimize operations, improve efficiency, and drive strategic outcomes.\\n\\n## Section 3: Ethical AI and Transparency\\n\\nAs AI technologies become more pervasive in society, the need for ethical AI frameworks and transparency measures becomes paramount. In 2025, the focus on responsible AI deployment will intensify, with organizations prioritizing ethical considerations in AI development and deployment. From bias mitigation algorithms to explainable AI models, the emphasis on ethical AI practices will ensure that AI automation aligns with societal values and fosters trust among users and stakeholders.\\n\\n## Conclusion: Embracing the AI-Driven Future\\n\\nThe year 2025 heralds a new era of AI automation, where innovation, personalization, and ethical considerations converge to redefine the possibilities of technology. As businesses navigate this dynamic landscape, embracing the transformative power of AI automation will be imperative to staying competitive and driving sustainable growth. By harnessing the latest trends in AI automation, organizations can unlock new opportunities, streamline operations, and create value for both customers and stakeholders in the years to come.\\n\\nThis blog post provides a glimpse into the exciting AI automation trends that are shaping the future of technology and business in 2025. Stay tuned as we explore further insights and developments in the ever-evolving world of AI automation. Exciting times lie ahead as we journey towards a smarter, more connected future empowered by AI innovation.\\n\\n## Content Metadata\\n- **Word Count**: 600 words\\n- **Reading Time**: 3 minutes\\n- **Target Audience**: Business leaders, technology enthusiasts, AI professionals\\n- **Content Type**: Trend analysis and future outlook in AI automation\\n\\n## SEO Elements\\n- **Meta Description**: \\"Discover the top AI automation trends shaping 2025. Explore AI-powered personalization, autonomous decision-making, and ethical AI practices for a glimpse into the future.\\"\\n- **Primary Keywords**: AI automation trends 2025, future of AI automation, AI technology trends\\n- **Secondary Keywords**: AI innovation, AI-driven decision-making, ethical AI frameworks, AI transparency\\n- **Tags**: AI automation, artificial intelligence, technology trends, future tech, AI ethics, automation innovation\\n\\nThis blog post serves as a comprehensive overview of the transformative AI automation trends that are set to define the year 2025. By staying informed and proactive in adopting these trends, businesses can position themselves at the forefront of technological advancement and drive sustainable growth in the AI-driven future.","metadata":{"agentName":"Content Agent","agentType":"specialist","contextUsed":true,"contextLength":20404,"processedAt":"2025-08-06T10:39:29.528Z"}}	{"agentName": "Content Agent", "agentType": "specialist", "contextUsed": true, "processedAt": "2025-08-06T10:39:29.528Z", "contextLength": 20404}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-06 10:39:29.529+00	300	{}	2025-08-06 10:39:21.668562+00	2025-08-06 10:39:29.794767+00	text	{}
e387dfde-4c9a-48aa-aa9b-494949ebb918	a5600c89-50f5-45b1-9569-13c9ec1512e3	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	test	Hello	{"userMessage": "Hello"}	\N	{}	failed	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	Hiverarchy authentication failed: No access token received from Hiverarchy	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-30 15:01:06.460591+00	2025-07-30 15:01:06.999143+00	text	{}
e5ab5176-1a31-42ca-a767-06f0db39dd16	52d6b373-7f83-4eac-b9ff-e42b7f168f29	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	executeTask	Write requirements for a simple todo list application. Include user stories, functional requirements, and technical specifications.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"# Product Requirements Document (PRD) for Simple Todo List Application\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\nThe Simple Todo List Application is designed to help users manage their tasks efficiently. This application will allow users to create, delete, and mark tasks as completed. The system will consist of a frontend application for user interaction, a backend server for processing requests, and a database to store task information. The implementation of user authentication will ensure data security and personalized task lists.\\n\\n## 2. Product Overview\\n### Goals:\\n- Provide users with a simple and intuitive platform to manage their tasks effectively.\\n- Ensure seamless task creation, deletion, and tracking functionalities.\\n- Enhance user productivity and organization through a user-friendly interface.\\n\\n### Objectives:\\n- Develop a responsive frontend application for task management.\\n- Implement a secure backend server to handle user requests and data processing.\\n- Create a scalable database system to store user tasks efficiently.\\n\\n### Success Metrics:\\n- User engagement metrics (e.g., daily active users, task completion rates).\\n- User retention rates and recurring usage patterns.\\n- System performance metrics (e.g., response times, error rates).\\n\\n## 3. User Personas & Use Cases\\n### Target Users:\\n1. **Busy Professionals**: Individuals looking to organize their daily tasks and prioritize work efficiently.\\n2. **Students**: Users seeking a tool to manage assignments, projects, and study schedules.\\n3. **Homemakers**: Individuals managing household chores, shopping lists, and family activities.\\n\\n### User Needs:\\n- Simple task creation and deletion functionalities.\\n- Clear task display with completion status.\\n- Secure access to personal task lists.\\n- Intuitive user interface for seamless task management.\\n\\n## 4. Functional Requirements\\n1. **Task Creation**:\\n   - Users can add tasks with a title and description.\\n2. **Task Deletion**:\\n   - Users can delete tasks from the list.\\n3. **Task Completion Status**:\\n   - Users can mark tasks as completed.\\n4. **Frontend Application**:\\n   - User-friendly interface for task management.\\n5. **Backend Server**:\\n   - Handles user requests for task operations.\\n6. **Database**:\\n   - Stores task information securely.\\n7. **Task List Display**:\\n   - Shows tasks with titles, descriptions, and completion status.\\n8. **Task Creation Form**:\\n   - Provides a form for users to input task details.\\n9. **Task Completion Toggle**:\\n   - Allows users to toggle task completion status.\\n10. **User Authentication**:\\n    - Secure login and authentication for user accounts.\\n\\n## 5. User Stories\\n### Story 1: Task Creation\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - User can input task title and description.\\n  - User can submit the task for creation.\\n- **Workflow**:\\n  - User fills task details in the creation form.\\n  - User clicks on the \\"Add Task\\" button.\\n\\n### Story 2: Task Deletion\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - User can delete a task from the list.\\n- **Workflow**:\\n  - User clicks on the delete icon next to the task.\\n  - System prompts for confirmation before deletion.\\n\\n## 6. Non-Functional Requirements\\n- **Performance**: System should respond to user actions within 1 second.\\n- **Security**: Implement data encryption for user authentication and task storage.\\n- **Scalability**: Design system to handle increasing user load and task volumes.\\n\\n## 7. Technical Considerations\\n- **Frontend**: Develop using React framework for responsiveness.\\n- **Backend**: Use Node.js for server-side logic.\\n- **Database**: Implement MySQL for task data storage.\\n- **Authentication**: Use JWT tokens for user login and session management.\\n\\n## 8. Implementation Timeline\\n1. **Week 1-2**:\\n   - Set up frontend development environment.\\n   - Design user interface wireframes.\\n2. **Week 3-4**:\\n   - Develop backend server for API endpoints.\\n   - Implement database schema for task storage.\\n3. **Week 5-6**:\\n   - Integrate frontend with backend for task management.\\n   - Implement user authentication system.\\n4. **Week 7**:\\n   - Conduct testing and QA.\\n   - Prepare for deployment.\\n\\n## 9. Success Metrics\\n- **KPIs**:\\n  - Daily active users: 1000+\\n  - Task completion rate: 80%+\\n- **Measurement Criteria**:\\n  - Track user engagement through analytics tools.\\n  - Monitor server response times and error rates.\\n\\n## 10. Risk Assessment\\n### Potential Challenges:\\n1. **Security Vulnerabilities**:\\n   - Mitigation: Regular security audits and updates.\\n2. **Scalability Issues**:\\n   - Mitigation: Implement load testing and optimize database queries.\\n3. **User Adoption**:\\n   - Mitigation: Gather user feedback for continuous improvement.\\n\\nThis PRD outlines the detailed requirements for the Simple Todo List Application, focusing on user needs, functionality, technical aspects, and success criteria. By following this roadmap, the development team can build a robust and user-centric task management system.","metadata":{"agentType":"engineering","executionType":"python_script","scriptPath":"/Users/golfergeek/projects/golfergeek/orchestrator-ai/apps/api/src/agents/actual/engineering/requirements_writer/agent-function.py","processedAt":"2025-08-06T11:37:00.899Z","method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"executeTask","prompt":"Write requirements for a simple todo list application. Include user stories, functional requirements, and technical specifications.","taskId":"e5ab5176-1a31-42ca-a767-06f0db39dd16","currentUser":{"id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-08-06T11:36:39.330Z","createdAt":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.557Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-06T11:36:39.332Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"bd517515-cb47-40de-ae10-5ac590c1c29e","id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","user_id":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7","identity_data":{"email":"testuser@golfergeek.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566752Z","created_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z","email":"testuser@golfergeek.com"}]},"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..h7EN3VaPFsP2gBEv0R0Dq0tzjM_H_-GlbTovYE-RVAc","conversationHistory":[]},"agentName":"Requirements Writer","timestamp":"2025-08-06T11:36:39.724Z","taskId":"e5ab5176-1a31-42ca-a767-06f0db39dd16","llmPreferences":{}}}	{"method": "processTask", "taskId": "e5ab5176-1a31-42ca-a767-06f0db39dd16", "features": ["Task creation", "Task deletion", "Task completion status", "Frontend application", "Backend server", "Database for storing tasks", "Task list display", "Task creation form", "Task completion toggle", "User authentication"], "agentName": "Requirements Writer", "timestamp": "2025-08-06T11:36:39.724Z", "agent_type": "requirements_writer", "complexity": "medium", "tools_used": ["langgraph", "real-llm-calls", "modular-nodes", "state-management"], "generated_at": "2025-08-06T06:37:00.591243", "document_type": "prd", "workflow_step": "completed", "content_length": 4904, "llmPreferences": {}, "originalParams": {"method": "executeTask", "prompt": "Write requirements for a simple todo list application. Include user stories, functional requirements, and technical specifications.", "taskId": "e5ab5176-1a31-42ca-a767-06f0db39dd16", "authToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..h7EN3VaPFsP2gBEv0R0Dq0tzjM_H_-GlbTovYE-RVAc", "currentUser": {"id": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "aud": "authenticated", "role": "authenticated", "email": "testuser@golfergeek.com", "phone": "", "createdAt": "2025-05-22T14:46:52.557Z", "updatedAt": "2025-08-06T11:36:39.332Z", "identities": [{"id": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "email": "testuser@golfergeek.com", "user_id": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "provider": "email", "created_at": "2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-22T14:46:52.566827Z", "identity_id": "bd517515-cb47-40de-ae10-5ac590c1c29e", "identity_data": {"sub": "db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7", "email": "testuser@golfergeek.com", "email_verified": false, "phone_verified": false}, "last_sign_in_at": "2025-05-22T14:46:52.566752Z"}], "appMetadata": {"provider": "email", "providers": ["email"]}, "confirmedAt": "2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z", "lastSignInAt": "2025-08-06T11:36:39.330Z", "userMetadata": {"email_verified": true}, "emailConfirmedAt": "2025-05-22T14:46:52.570Z"}, "conversationHistory": []}, "processing_type": "modular-langgraph-workflow", "workflow_status": "success", "document_sections": 19, "processing_method": "real_llm_calls", "features_identified": 10, "completion_timestamp": "2025-08-06T06:37:00.590522", "total_workflow_steps": 9, "workflow_steps_completed": ["analyze_request", "determine_document_type", "extract_features", "assess_complexity", "generate_document", "finalize_response"]}	completed	100	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-08-06 11:37:00.674+00	1800	{}	2025-08-06 11:36:39.544126+00	2025-08-06 11:37:01.001855+00	text	{}
c82583d9-41b4-4f85-a133-19f090ed843c	a5600c89-50f5-45b1-9569-13c9ec1512e3	db94682e-5184-496f-93fd-dc739aa0f9e7	handle_request	Write a blog post about AI in healthcare	{"userMessage": "Write a blog post about AI in healthcare"}	\N	{}	failed	0	Task created, waiting for execution...	{}	{}	\N	Hiverarchy authentication failed: No access token received from Hiverarchy	\N	\N	\N	300	{}	2025-07-30 15:03:34.631022+00	2025-07-30 15:03:35.17301+00	text	{}
796975b6-435b-4a51-a372-afcd981c1f6f	47ee8d3d-f85b-4a2f-ace2-ffdb12081018	09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b	process	You write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain.	{}	{"success":true,"response":"# 📋 Marketing Content Package\\n\\n**MARKETING CONTENT PACKAGE**\\n\\n**Blog Post: Mastering the Elements: A Guide to Playing Golf in the Rain**\\n\\n**Introduction:**\\nEmbrace the challenge of playing golf in the rain with our comprehensive guide. Discover how to enhance your skills, adapt your strategy, and enjoy a unique golfing experience despite the weather.\\n\\n**Tips for Playing in the Rain:**\\n1. **Proper Gear:** Invest in quality rain gear to stay dry and focused.\\n2. **Club Selection:** Adjust clubs for wet conditions to improve ball control.\\n3. **Grip and Stance:** Modify grip and stance for stability on slippery surfaces.\\n4. **Mindset:** Approach rainy rounds with a positive mindset to boost performance.\\n5. **Ball Position:** Tee the ball higher to prevent waterlogging and maintain distance.\\n\\n**Benefits of Playing Golf in the Rain:**\\n- **Improved Adaptability:** Enhance resilience and adaptability on the course.\\n- **Skill Development:** Improve ball-striking and shot-making skills.\\n- **Enjoyment:** Experience a unique and rewarding golfing adventure.\\n\\n**Conclusion:**\\nDon't let a little rain stop you from enjoying the game you love. Embrace the challenge, elevate your skills, and show the elements who's boss on the course!\\n\\n**Call to Action:**\\nShare your rain-soaked golfing adventures with us and inspire others to embrace the elements. Remember, a little rain shouldn't dampen your passion for golf!\\n\\n**Implementation Guidance:**\\n- Incorporate relevant keywords like 'playing golf in the rain' and 'rainy day golf tips' throughout the blog post for SEO optimization.\\n- Maintain a consistent brand voice and tone to strengthen brand identity and engage the audience emotionally.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Social Media Post: Mastering the Elements: A Golfer's Guide to Playing in the Rain**\\n\\n**Introduction:**\\nDiscover the thrill of playing golf in the rain and why it can be a rewarding and exhilarating experience for true golf enthusiasts.\\n\\n**Tips for Playing Golf in the Rain:**\\n1. **Stay Dry:** Invest in quality waterproof gear to stay comfortable and focused.\\n2. **Adjust Your Strategy:** Make strategic adjustments to your game for wet conditions.\\n3. **Stay Positive:** Embrace the challenge and appreciate the beauty of a rain-soaked course.\\n\\n**Share Your Rainy Golf Experience:**\\nJoin the #RainyGolfChallenge and share your stories, tips, and photos to inspire fellow golf enthusiasts to embrace the rain on the course.\\n\\n**Conclusion:**\\nImmerse yourself in the elements, challenge your skills, and deepen your connection with the game by playing golf in the rain. Tee off with confidence, rain or shine!\\n\\n**Implementation Guidance:**\\n- Use hashtags like #RainyGolfChallenge to encourage user-generated content and engagement.\\n- Share the post across social media platforms to reach a wider audience and inspire more players to embrace the elements.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Actionable Recommendations:**\\n1. Implement meta descriptions for the blog post to improve search visibility and click-through rates.\\n2. Infuse emotional storytelling in social media posts to deepen audience engagement and connection with the content.\\n3. Share the blog post on social media platforms with a consistent brand voice and tone to strengthen brand identity.\\n\\n**Next Steps:**\\n- Publish the blog post on your website and optimize it for SEO with relevant keywords.\\n- Share the social media post across platforms and encourage user participation in the #RainyGolfChallenge.\\n- Monitor engagement metrics and user responses to refine future marketing strategies.\\n\\nThis comprehensive Marketing Content Package combines compelling storytelling, actionable tips, and engagement strategies to inspire golf enthusiasts to embrace the challenge of playing golf in the rain.\\n\\n## Individual Content Pieces\\n\\n### Blog Post Writer\\nTitle: Mastering the Elements: A Guide to Playing Golf in the Rain\\n\\nIntroduction:\\nAs golf enthusiasts, we all know the thrill of hitting the perfect shot on a sunny day. But what about those rainy days when the course is wet, and the skies are cloudy? Don't let a little rain dampen your love for the game! In this comprehensive guide, we will explore the art of playing golf in the rain and how you can still enjoy a great round despite the weather.\\n\\nEmbracing the Challenge:\\nPlaying golf in the rain presents a unique set of challenges that can actually enhance your skills and test your adaptability. The rain alters the course conditions, requiring you to adjust your strategy and approach. By mastering the elements, you can improve your game and gain a competitive edge over fair-weather golfers.\\n\\nTips for Playing in the Rain:\\n1. Proper Gear: Invest in quality rain gear, including waterproof jackets, pants, and gloves. Stay dry to maintain your comfort and focus throughout the round.\\n2. Club Selection: Adjust your club selection based on the wet conditions. Opt for more lofted clubs to help you get the ball in the air and avoid skidding on the wet grass.\\n3. Grip and Stance: Modify your grip and stance to account for the slippery conditions. Use a lighter grip pressure and widen your stance for better stability and control.\\n4. Mindset: Embrace the challenge of playing in the rain with a positive mindset. Stay focused, adapt to the conditions, and see it as an opportunity to improve your skills.\\n5. Ball Position: Tee the ball slightly higher to prevent it from getting waterlogged and losing distance. Adjust your ball position based on the lie and conditions of the fairway.\\n\\nBenefits of Playing Golf in the Rain:\\n- Improved Adaptability: Playing in adverse weather conditions enhances your adaptability and resilience on the course.\\n- Skill Development: Mastering the art of playing in the rain can improve your ball-striking, shot-making, and overall performance.\\n- Enjoyment: Embracing the challenge of playing in the rain can lead to a unique and enjoyable golfing experience that you wouldn't get on a sunny day.\\n\\nConclusion:\\nPlaying golf in the rain may not be everyone's cup of tea, but for those willing to embrace the challenge, it can be a rewarding and enriching experience. By following the tips outlined in this guide and approaching the game with a positive mindset, you can elevate your skills, test your adaptability, and enjoy the beauty of golf in all weather conditions. So, next time the rain clouds gather, grab your gear, hit the course, and show the elements who's boss!\\n\\nCall to Action:\\nReady to take on the challenge of playing golf in the rain? Share your rain-soaked golfing adventures with us in the comments below and inspire others to embrace the elements on the course! Remember, a little rain shouldn't stop you from enjoying the game you love.\\n\\n### Social Media Specialist\\nTitle: Mastering the Elements: A Golfer's Guide to Playing in the Rain\\n\\nIntroduction:\\nFor avid golfers, there's nothing quite like the thrill of teeing off under ominous rain clouds, the smell of petrichor in the air, and the challenge of navigating a wet course. While many might seek shelter when the rain starts falling, true golf enthusiasts know that playing in the rain can be a rewarding and exhilarating experience.\\n\\nWhy Play Golf in the Rain?\\n1. Sharpen Your Skills: Playing in adverse weather conditions can help improve your game by forcing you to adapt your strategy, focus on precision, and test your mental toughness.\\n2. Enjoy Quieter Courses: Rainy days often mean fewer golfers on the course, giving you the opportunity for a more peaceful and serene round.\\n3. Embrace the Elements: Golf is an outdoor sport, and playing in the rain allows you to connect with nature and experience the game in a different light.\\n\\nTips for Playing Golf in the Rain:\\n1. Stay Dry: Invest in quality waterproof gear, including a reliable rain suit, waterproof golf shoes, and an umbrella to keep yourself comfortable and focused.\\n2. Adjust Your Strategy: Wet conditions require adjustments to your game, such as club selection, ball placement, and swing technique. Take your time to assess the course and make strategic decisions.\\n3. Stay Positive: A positive attitude is key to enjoying a rainy round of golf. Embrace the challenge, focus on the present moment, and appreciate the beauty of the rain-soaked course.\\n\\nShare Your Rainy Golf Experience:\\nHave you ever braved the rain for a round of golf? Share your stories, tips, and photos with us using the hashtag #RainyGolfChallenge. Let's celebrate the spirit of golfing in all weather conditions and inspire fellow golf enthusiasts to embrace the rain!\\n\\nConclusion:\\nPlaying golf in the rain is not just about hitting the ball; it's about immersing yourself in the elements, challenging your skills, and fostering a deeper connection with the game. So next time the rain clouds roll in, don't shy away from the course—embrace the challenge, gear up, and tee off with confidence. Remember, a little rain can't dampen the passion of a true golfer!\\n\\nShare this post with your fellow golf enthusiasts and let's spread the love for golfing in all weather conditions. Together, we can inspire more players to embrace the elements and enjoy the game to the fullest. Happy golfing, rain or shine! ⛳☔ #RainyGolfChallenge #GolfEnthusiasts #MasteringTheElements\\n","metadata":{"agentType":"specialist","functionStatus":"executed","processedAt":"2025-08-05T19:39:09.743Z","method":"processTask","originalParams":{"method":"process","prompt":"You write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain.","taskId":"796975b6-435b-4a51-a372-afcd981c1f6f","currentUser":{"id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","email":"golfergeek@gmail.com","aud":"authenticated","role":"authenticated","appMetadata":{"provider":"email","providers":["email"]},"userMetadata":{"email_verified":true},"phone":"","emailConfirmedAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.491Z","confirmedAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.491Z","lastSignInAt":"2025-08-05T16:10:23.405Z","createdAt":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.474Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-05T18:56:33.394Z","identities":[{"identity_id":"7c4d7009-91f8-4e8b-b28d-7f8b52a17a0b","id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","user_id":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b","identity_data":{"email":"golfergeek@gmail.com","email_verified":false,"phone_verified":false,"sub":"09f41d4d-1697-4141-a0de-3e258faae92b"},"provider":"email","last_sign_in_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.48662Z","created_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.486679Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T18:46:51.486679Z","email":"golfergeek@gmail.com"}]},"authToken":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IkxwM1hCMXIvL0ZEQzNUSjMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..H2hrOWGYac3Kqm8i5n2880jCtQLK-rBBl7XcTGJGHdU","llmSelection":{"providerId":"7e157b23-07bb-47cd-9fe6-2c024d69ef6f","modelId":"494308ba-afb1-4bc8-983f-5acdec5920d4","cidafmOptions":{"activeStateModifiers":[],"responseModifiers":[],"executedCommands":[],"customOptions":{"customModifiers":[]}},"temperature":0.7},"conversationHistory":[{"role":"assistant","content":"Hello! I'm the Content. How can I help you today?","timestamp":"2025-08-05T19:37:27.111Z","metadata":{"isWelcome":true}},{"role":"user","content":"Write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain.","timestamp":"2025-08-05T19:37:34.460Z"},{"role":"user","content":"You write me a blog post about playing golf in the rain.","timestamp":"2025-08-05T19:38:46.253Z"}]},"agentName":"marketing-swarm","timestamp":"2025-08-05T19:38:47.307Z","taskId":"796975b6-435b-4a51-a372-afcd981c1f6f","processingType":"multi-agent-orchestration","processingTime":22180,"toolsUsed":["llm-service","langgraph","agent-coordination"],"responseType":"comprehensive-content-package","swarm_workfl